<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1 Khang Tangthu</book>
  <para style="h">1 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Khang Tangthu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam, Seth, Enosh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenan, Mahalalel, Jared;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noah, Shem, Ham, le Japheth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Japheth’ suonlehlahte: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, le Tiras.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer’ suonlehlahte: Ashkenaz, Diphath, le Togarmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Javan suonlehlahte: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, le Rodanim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ham’ suonlehlahte: Cush, Egypt, Put, le Canaan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cush’ suonlehlahte: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raama, le Sabteca. Raamah’ suonlehlahte: Sheba, le Dedan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cush pen Nimrod’ pa ahi hi; ama pen leitungah mihat masa pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt pen Lud-te, Anam-te, Lehab-te, Naphtuh-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathrus-te, Casluh-te, le Caphtor-te’ pa ahi a, ama sung panin Philistia-te a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Canaan pen a tacil Sidon le Heth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />le Jebus-te, Amor-te, Girgash-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv-te, Ark-te, Sin-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad-te, Zemar-te le Hamath-te’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Shem’ suonlehlahte: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether, le Meshech.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpachshad pen Shelah’ pa; Shelah pen Eber’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eber sung panin in tapa ni pieng hi: Khat pa’ min Peleg hi a, (a zieh pen ama hunin leitung kikhen hi) a sanggampa’ min Joktan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jokton pen Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ophir, Havilah, le Jobab-te’ pa ahi hi; tam teng zosie pen Jokton’ suonlehlahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shem, Arpachshad, Shelah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber, Peleg, Reu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Serug, Nahor, le Terah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham a kici Abram ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham’ tapate: Isaac le Ishmael ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam teng a khangsimna uh ahi hi: Ishmael’ tacil Nebaioth; tuale Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetur, Naphish, le Kedemah. Tam teng pen Ishmael’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abraham’ a meinu Keturah’ tapate: Ama in Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, le Shuah. Jokshan’ tapate: Sheba le Dedan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midian’ tapate: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, le Eldaah-te ahi uhi. Tam teng zosie Keturah’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abraham pen Isaac’ pa ahi hi. Isaac’ tapate: Esau le Israel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Esau’ tapate: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, le Korah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Eliphaz’ tapate: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, le Amalek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuel’ tapate: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, le Mizzah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Seir’ tapate: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, le Dishan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lotan’ tapate: Hori le Homam; Lotan’ sanggamnu pen Timna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Shobal’ tapate: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shephi, le Onam. Zibeon’ tapate: Aiah le Anah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Anah’ tapa: Dishon. Dishon’ tapate: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran, le Cheran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ezer’ tapate: Bilhan, Zaavan, le Jaakan. Dishan’ tapate: Uz le Aran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel-te tungah koima kumpi in a uh masangin Edom gam sunga a uh kumpite: Beor’ tapa Bela ahi a, ama khuopi min pen Dinhabah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bela a si ciengin Bozrah-te Zerah’ tapa Jobab in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jobab a si ciengin Teman-te’ gammi Husham in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Husham a si ciengin Moab gama Midian-te a zo pa, Bedad’ tapa Hadad in ama’ za luo hi; a khuopi min pen Avith ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hadad a si ciengin Masrekah-te Samlah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Samlah a si ciengin Euphrates gun gei-a om Rehoboth-te Shaul in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Shaul a si ciengin Achbor’ tapa Baal-hanan in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Baal-hanan a si ciengin Hadad in ama’ za luo hi; ama’ khuopi min pen Pai ahi a, a zi’ min pen Mehetabel hi a, Me-zahab’ tunu, Matred’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuale Hadad a si hi. Edom’ bete: Bete Timnah, Aliah, Jetheth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Magdiel, le Iram ahi uhi. Tam teng pen Edom’ bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel’ tapate ahi uhi: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad, le Asher.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah’ tapate: Er, Onan, le Shelah; tam teng thum pen Canaan numei Bath-shua tawh a nei ahi hi. Tu-in Topa muna-ah Judah’ tacil Er pen siet gamtat a, ama in tua pa that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A monu Tamar in zong Perez le Zerah nei hi. Judah in a unpi-in tapa nga nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Perez’ tapate: Hezron le Hamul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerah’ tapate: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, le Dara, a unpi-un nga pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Carmi’ tapate: Israel a subuoi, sil ki-apte vai-a a khiel, Israel Achar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />le Ethan’ tapa pen Azariah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama sung pana a suoh Hezron’ tapate: Jerahmeel, Ram, le Chelubai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram pen Amminadab’ pa ahi a, Amminadab pen Judah tapate sung pan ulien Nahshon’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nashon pen Salma’ pa, Salma pen Boaz’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Boaz pen Obed’ pa, Obed pen Jessi’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jessi pen a tacil Eliab, a nina Abinadab, a thumna Shimea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a lina Nethanel, a ngana Raddai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a guhna Ozem, a sagina David’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau’ sanggam numeite pen Zeruiah le Abigail ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abigail in Amasa nei a, Amasa’ pa pen Ishmael-te Jether ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezron’ tapa Caleb in a zi Azubah le Jerioth tawh ta nei hi; tam teng a tapate ahi uhi: Jesher, Shobab, le Ardon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azubah a si ciengin Caleb in Ephrath tenpi a, tua nu in ama tawh Hur nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hur pen Uri’ pa hi a, Uri pen Bezalel’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama kum sawmguh a cin zaw ciengin Hezron in a tenpi Gilead’ pa Machir’ tanu a luppi hi; tuale ama in tua nu tawh Segub nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Segub pen Jair’ pa ahi a, ama in Gilead gam sungah khuopi sawmni le thum nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Geshur le Aram in amate tung panin Havvoth-jair, Kenath le a khuotate khuopi sawmguh a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezron a si zaw ciengin Caleb-ephrathah ah Caleb in Hezron’ zi Abijah tawh Tekoa’ pa Ashhur nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hezron’ tacil Jerahmeel’ tapate: A tacil Ram, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, le Ahijah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerahmeel in zi dang khat zong nei a, a min Atarah ahi hi; tua nu Onam’ nu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerahmeel’ tacil Ram’ tapate: Maaz, Jamin, le Eker.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Onam’ tapate: Shammai le Jada. Shammai’ tapate: Nadab le Abishur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abishur’ zi min Abihail ahi a, ama in ama tawh Ahban le Molid nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nadab’ tapate: Seled le Appaim ahi hi; ta nei loin Seled a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Appaim’ tapa: Ishi. Ishi’ tapa: Sheshan. Sheshan’ tapa: Ahlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shammai’ sanggampa Jada’ tapate: Jether le Jonathan. Ta nei loin Jether a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jonathan’ tapate: Peleth le Zaza. Tam teng Jerahmeel’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu-in Shesan in tapa nei loin tanute beh nei hi; ahi vangin Sheshan in Egypt mi sila khat nei a, a min Jarha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n Sheshan in a silapa Jarha tawh a tanu kinungsah hi; tua nu in ama tawh Attai nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Attai pen Nathan’ pa hi a, Nathan pen Zabad’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zabad pen Ephlal’ pa hi a, Ephlal pen Obed’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed pen Jehu’ pa hi a, Jehu pen Azariah’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azariah pen Helez’ pa hi a, Helez pen Eleasah’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eleash pen Sismai’ pa hi a, Sismai pen Shallum’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Shallum pen Jekamiah’ pa hi a, tuale Jekamaih pen Elishama’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerahmeel’ sanggampa Caleb’ tapate: A tacil Mesha hi a, ama Ziph’ pa ahi hi. Mareshah’ tapa Hebron ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebron’ tapate: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem, le Shema.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Shema pen Raham’ pa ahi a, Raham pen Jorkeam’ pa ahi hi; tuale Rekem pen Shammai’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Shammai’ tapate: Maon. Moan pen Beth-zur’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Caleb’ meinu Ephah in zong Haran, Moza, le Gezez-te nei hi; tuale Haran pen Gazez’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jahdai’ tapate: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, le Shaaph.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Caleb’ meinu Maacah in Sheber le Tirhanah nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua nu in Madmannah’ pa Shaaph, Macbenah’ pa Sheva, le Gibea zong nei hi; tuale Caleb’ tanu pen Achsah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tam teng pen Caleb’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi. Ephrathah’ tacil Hur’ tapate: Kiriath-jearim’ pa Shobal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bethlehem’ pa Salma le Beth-gader’ pa Hareph.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim’ pa Shobal in tapa dangte nei hi: Haroeh, Menuhoth-te a langkhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim innkuonte: Ithri-te, Puth-te, Shumath-te, le Mishrai-te; tam teng sung panin Zorah-te le Eshtaol-te pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Salma’ tapate: Bethlehem, Netophah-te, Atroth-bethjoab-te, le Zor-te ahi Manahath minam ni sung pan alang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Jabez-a teng laithei innkuonte: Tirath-te, Shimeath-te, le Sucath-te. Tam teng pen Hamath pana pei Rechab innkuonte’ pa Ken-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Hebron-a suoh David’ tapate ahi uhi: A tacil pen Jezreel-te Ahinoam tawh a nei Amnon; a nina Carmel-te Abigail tawh a nei Daniel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a thumna Geshur Kumpipa Talmai’ tanu Maacah tawh a nei Absalom; a lina Haggith’ tapa Adonijah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a ngana Abital tawh a nei Shephatiah, a guhna a zi Eglah tawh a nei Ithream;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hebron ah kum sagi le hla guh a maan sungin ama sung panin guh suoh hi. Tuale Jerusalem ah ama kum sawmthum le kum thum sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam teng pen ama sung pan Jerusalem-a a suohte ahi uhi: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan, le Solomon, tam teng li pen Ammiel’ tanu Bath-shua tawh a nei ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ciengin Ibhar, Elishama, Eliphelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada, le Eliphelet, kuo pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng zosie a meite’ tapate a kisim lo David’ tapate ahi uhi. Tamar pen a sanggamnu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon’ suonlehlahte: Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam, a tapa Ahijah, a tapa Asa, a tapa Jehoshaphat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a tapa Joram, a tapa Ahaziah, a tapa Joash,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a tapa Amaziah, a tapa Azariah, a tapa Jotham,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a tapa Ahaz, a tapa Hezekiah, a tapa Manasseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a tapa Amon, a tapa Josiah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josiah’ tapate: A tacil Johanan, a nina Jehoiakim, a thumna Zedekiah, a lina Shallum-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakim’ suonlehlahte: A tapa Jeconiah le Zedekiah ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuale sala kiman Jeconiah’ tapate: a tapa Shealtiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama, le Nedabiah ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaiah’ tapate: Zerubbabel le Shimei ahi uhi; tuale Zerubbabel’ tapate: Meshullum le Hananiah hi a, Shelomith pen a sanggam nu uh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, le Jushab-hesed, nga nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hananiah’ tapate: Pelatiah le Jeshaiah hi a, Jeshaiah’ tapa Rephaiah, a tapa Arnan, a tapa Obadiah, a tapa Shecaniah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shecaniah’ tapa: Shemaih ahi hi. Shemaih’ tapate: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, le Shaphat, guh pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Neariah’ tapate: Elioenai, Hizkiah, le Azrikam, thum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elioenai’ tapate: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, le Anani, sagi pha uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah’ tapate: Perez, Hezron, Carmi, Hur, le Shobal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shobal’ tapa Reaiah pen Jahath’ pa hi a, Jahath pen Ahumai le Lahad’ pa ahi hi. Tam teng pen Zorath-te’ innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam teng pen Etam’ tapate ahi uhi: Jezreel, Ishma, Idbash; tuale a sanggamnu uh’ min pen Hazzelelponi ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale Penuel pen Gedor’ pa hi a, Ezer pen Hushah’ pa ahi hi. Tam teng pen Ephrathah’ tacil, Bethlehem’ pa Hur’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa’ pa Ashhur in zi ni, Helah le Naarah nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Naarah in ama tawh Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, le Haahashtari nei hi. Tam teng pen Naarah’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Helah’ tapate: Zereth, Izhar, le Ethnan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Koz pen Anub, Zobebah’ Harum’ tapa pen Aharhel’ innkuonte’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabez pen a sanggamte sangin a zatah huoi zaw hi; tuale a nu in, “Gimpi-a ama ka nei ahi ziehin,” ci-in a min Jabez a phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabez in Israel Pasien kungah thungen a, “Aw, keima thupha ei pie inlen, ka gamgi ei kehpieh in, na khut tawh ei ompi inlen, gimna le sietna panin ei kem in!” a ci hi. Tuale Pasien in ama’ ngetna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shuhah’ sanggampa Chelub pen Mehir’ pa hi a, Mehir pen Eshton’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eshton pen Beth-rapha, Paseah-te’ pa hi a, Tehinnah pen Ir-nahash’ pa ahi hi. Tam teng Recah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaz’ tapate: Othniel le Seraiah. Othniel’ tapate: Hathath le Meonothai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meonothai pen Ophrah’ pa ahi hi; tuale Seraiah pen Joab’ pa hi a, Joab pen Ge-harashim’ pa ahi hi. Amate pen khutsiem mite ahi ziehun tua bang kici ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb’ tapate: Iru, Elah, le Naam. Elah’ tapa: Kenaz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehallelel’ tapate: Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria, le Asarel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ezrah’ tapate: Jether, Mered, Epher, le Jalon. Tam teng pen Mered tawh kiteng Pharaoh’ tanu Bithiah’ tapate ahi uhi. Ama gai-in Miriam, Shammai, le Eshtemeo’ pa pen Ishbah nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A Judea zi in Gedor’ pa Jered, Soco’ pa Heber, le Zanoah’ pa Jekuthiel nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naham’ sanggamnu Hodiah’ zi tapate pen Garm-te Keilah le Maacath-te Eshtemoa’ pa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimon’ tapate: Amnon, Rinn ah, Ben-hanan, Tilon. Ishi’ tapate: Zoheth le Ben-zoheth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah’ tapa Shelah’ tapate: Lecah’ pa Er le Mareshah’ pa Laadah le Beth-ashbea-a saihadiel puon a gan innkuonte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuale Jokim, le Cozeba mite, Moab numeite a kinunpi Joash le Saraph te ahi vua, ahi vangin Lehem ah kilekia uhi. (Tam pen tangtawng lai-a ciemtena ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng pen beelkhengte ahi uhi; Netaim le Gederah-a tengte ahi uhi; ama na sem dingin khum munah kumpipa tawh amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeon’ tapate: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah, Shaul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Shallum pen Shaul’ tapa hi a, a tapa Mibsam, a tapa Mishma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mishma’ tapate: Hamuel pen a tapa ahi a, Zaccur a tapa hi-in Shimei a tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Shimei in tapa sawm le guh le tanu guh nei hi; hinanle a sanggamte in ta tampi a nei sih vua, amau’ innkuon pen Judea-te bangin a pung sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate Beer-sheba, Moladah, Hazarshual
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth-marcaboth, Hazar-susim, Beth-biri, le Shaaraim ah a teng uhi. Tam teng pen David kumpi a suo masanga a khuopite uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuale a khuoneute uh Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Tochen, le Ashan, khuopi ngate le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baal cieng dong tam khuopite kimvela om khuoneute zosie tawh ahi hi. Tam teng pen amau’ tenna hi a, amate in khangsimna laibu a kem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meshobab, Jamlech, Amaziah’ tapa Joshash,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Joel, Asiel’ tapa Seriah, a tapa Joshibiah, a tapa Jehu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elioenai, Jaakobah, Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Shemaiah’ tapa Shimri, a tapa Jedaiah, a tapa Allon, a tapa Shiphi’ tapa Ziza ahi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a min tawh kilo tam mite pen amau’ innkuon cietah makaite ahi vua, amau’ be pen nahpitahin a khang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ganhonte uh’ neh ding lonona sui-in nisuona kuom panglam, Gedor lutna-ah khuol a zin vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />amate in tua munah lei hoi, lonona mun a mu vua, tua leitang pen gam tanzau, gamsip, le kilemna mun a hi hi; azieh pen khum sunga a teng masate pen Ham-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Judah kumpi Hezekiah’ hun sungin a min a kiciemte tam mite pei-in, amate in tua sunga a mu uh Meunim mite le amau’ puonbuhte simin tuni dongin amate a cigamsah vua, tua munah a tuuhonte uh neh ding lonona om ahi ziehin amau’ munah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kimkhat, Simeon-te mi zanga, Seir Muolah a pei vua, tuale amate in Ishi’ tapate Pelatiah, Neariah, Rephaiah, le Uzziel makai-in a nei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />amate in a suohta Amalek-te a omlai teng a susie vua, khum munah tuni dongin a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel’ tacil pen Reuben’ tapate ahi a, (Ama tacil ahi a, ahi vangin a pa’ lupna a buasah ziehin Israel’ tapa Joseph tungah ama’ innluoza kipie hi. Tuaci’n khangsimna ah innluoza tawh kizui-in ama kikhum lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a sanggamte lahah Judah mi thupi suoh a, ama sung panin uhpa khat a pien vangin innluoza pen Joseph-a’ ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel’ tacil Reuben’ tapate: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, le Carmi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joel’ tapate: A tapa Shemaiah, a tapa Gog, a tapa Shimei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a tapa Micah, a tapa Reaiah, a tapa Baal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />le a tapa Beerah, Assyria kumpi Tilgath-pilneser in sala a peipi pa ahi hi; ama pen Reuben minamte lahah uhpi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale khanggui zui-in amau’ khangsutna a kisim ciengin a innkuonkhuon vua a tanaute: Uhpi Jeiel le Zechariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aroer-a teng Joel’ tapa Shema, a tapa Azaz, a tapa Bela. Nebo le Baalmeon cieng dongah amahaw a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama nisuona lamah Euphrates talam pang senel gam kipatna mun dong ciengah zong a teng hi. Azieh pen Gilead gam sungah a gantate uh a pung mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul hun lai-in amate in Hagri-te simin a zo uhi; tuale Gilead nisuona gam teng zosie-ah a puonbuhte sung vuah amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bashan gam sung Salecah donga a gei vua a teng Gad’ tapate:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bashan gamah uhpi Joel, a zom Shapham, Janai le Shaphat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale amau’ be dung zui-a a tanaute uh: Michael, Meshullum, Sheba, Jorai, Jacan, Zia, le Eber, sagi pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng pen Buz’ tapa Jahdo, a tapa Jeshishai, a tapa Michael, a tapa Gilead, a tapa Jaroah, a tapa Huri’ tapa Abihail’ tapate ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Guni’ tapa, Abdiel’ tapa Ahi pen amau’ be sungah uhpi ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate Gilead gamsung, Bashan gamsung le a khuopite sung, le Sharon gam lo nona mun zosie le tua gam a kiten theina cieng dongah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah kumpi Jotham hun sung, le Israel kumpi Jeroboam hun sung khangsimna-ah tam teng zosie kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alang in galhang mihat, lum le namsau a kuo, thalkap siem, galdo siem, mi tul sawmli le tulli le zasagi le sawmguh gal sim dingin a baisa-in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate Hagri-te, Jetur-te, Naphish-te, le Nodab-te tawh kido uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amate do nadingin panpina a nga ciengun Hagri-te le a kung vua om teng zosie, amau’ khut sungah kipie hi; azieh pen gal kidona sungah a Pasien kungah amate a kiko vua, ama a muon ziehin ama in amau’ ngetna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in a gantate matpieh uhi: A kalaoh uh tul sawmnga, tuu tul zani le tul sawmnga, laa tul ni, le mi tul zakhat hingmat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gal kidona pen Pasien-a’ ahi ziehin mi tampi tah kithatin a pua uhi. A sal suo dongun Hagri-te’ gam sungah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gam sungah Manasseh minam alang a teng uhi; Bashan panin Baal-hermon, Senir, le Hermon Muol tungah amate tengin tampi a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ be lutangte ahi uhi: Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah, le Jahdiel, a thahat galhangte, mi minthangte, amau’ be lutangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a pu a pate uh Pasien’ thu palsatin Pasien in a mai vua a suhsiet minamte’ pasiente lahah a kizua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel Pasien in Assyria kumpi Pul’ lungsim le Assyria kumpi Tilgath-pilneser’ lungsim tawhnawi a, Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte Halah, Habor, Hara le Gozan gunah a peipi a, tuni dongin a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi’ tapate: Gershom, Kohath, le Merari.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kohath’ tapate: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzzel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amram’ tate: Aaron, Moses, le Miriam. Aaron’ tapate: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phinehas’ pa Eleazar, Abishua’ pa Pinehas,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bukki’ pa Abishua, Uzzi’ pa Bukki,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerahiah’ pa Uzzi, Meraioth’ pa Zerahiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a Amariah’ pa Meraioth, Ahitub’ pa Amariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zadok’ pa Ahitub, Ahimaaz’ pa Zadok,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azariah’ pa Ahimaaz, Johanan’ pa Azariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />le Azariah’ pa Johanan (Jerusalem-a Solomon in a lam inn sunga siempu sempa) ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amariah’ pa Azariah, Ahitub’ pa Amariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zadok’ pa Ahitub, Shallum’ pa Zadok,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hilkiah’ pa Shallum, Azariah’ pa Hilkiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seraiah’ pa Azariah, Jehozadak’ pa Seraih ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuale Topa in Nebuchadnezzar’ khut tawh Judah le Jerusalem sala a mat ciengin Jehozadak zong salin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi’ tapate: Gershom, Kohath, le Merari.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam teng pen Gershom’ tapate ahi uhi: Libni le Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath’ tapate: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari’ tapate: Mahli le Mushi. Tam teng pen amau’ pu a pate dung zui-in Levi’ bete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gershom’ suonte: A tapa Libni, a tapa Jahath, a tapa Zimmah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a tapa Joah, a tapa Iddo, a tapa Zerah, a tapa Jeatherai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kohath’ tapate: A tapa Amminadab, a tapa Korah, a tapa Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a tapa Elkanah, a tapa Ebiasaph, a tapa Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a tapa Tahath, a tapa Uriel, a tapa Uzziah, le a tapa Shaul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkanah’ tapate: Amasai le Ahimoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a tapa Elkanah, a tapa, Zophai, a tapa Nahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a tapa Eliab, a tapa Jeroham, a tapa Elkanah, a tapa Samuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel’ tapate: A tacil Joel, a nina Abijah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Merari’ tapate: Mahli, a tapa Libni, a tapa Shimei, a tapa Uzza,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a tapa Shimea, a tapa Haggiah, le a tapa Asaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam teng pen Topa’ biehinn sunga thuciemna singkuong a tawlngah zaw cienga tua sungah Topa ’ biehinn sungah lasah nasepna uh dinga David in a koite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem-ah Topa’ biehinn a lam zo masangsie-in amate in kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh mai-ah lasahna tawh na a sem ahi uhi; tuale amate in a sep ding uh hun a kisesa bangin a banbanin a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A tapate utawh na semton mite tam teng ahi uhi: Kohath-te sung pan: Lasa pa Heman khu Joel’ tapa, Samuel’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elkanah’ tapa, Jehoram’ tapa, Eliel’ tapa, Toah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zuph’ tapa, Elkanah’ tapa, Mahath’ tapa, Amasai’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elkanah’ tapa, Joel’ tapa, Azariah’ tapa, Zephaniah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tahath’ tapa, Assir’ tapa, Ebiasaph’ tapa, Korah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Izhar’ tapa, Kohath’ tapa, Levi’ tapa, Israe’ tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuale ama’ ziet lama ding a sanggampa Asaph pen Berechiah’ tapa, Shimea’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Michael’ tapa, Baaseiah’ tapa, Machijah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ethni’ tapa, Zerah’ tapa, Adaiah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ethan’ tapa, Zimmah’ tapa, Shimei’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jahath’ tapa, Gershom’ tapa, Levi’ tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A vei lamah a tanau Merari’ tapate panin: Ethan pen Kishi’ tapa, Abdi’ tapa, Malluch’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hashabiah’ tapa, Amaziah’ tapa, Hilkiah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amzi’ tapa, Bani’ tapa, Shemer’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mahli’ tapa, Mushi’ tapa, Levi’ tapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />a sanggamte uh ahi Levi-te pen Topa’ inn biehbuh sunga nasepna zosie sem dinga kisete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin Aaron le a tapate in Pasien’ nasem Moses’ thupieh zosie tawh kizui-in siengtho pen mun nasepna zosie le Israel dinga thoidamna a bawl dingin, meihal biehna maitam tung le gimnamtui maitam tungah biehna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tam teng pen Aaron’ tapate ahi uhi: A tapa Eleazar, a tapa Phinehas, a tapa Abishua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />a tapa Bukki, a tapa Uzzi, a tapa Zerahiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />a tapa Meraioth, a tapa Amariah, a tapa Ahitub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />a tapa Zadok, a tapa Ahimaaz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Amate tungah aisanna a kieh masah ziehin Aaron’ tapate, Kohath-te’ innkuon in a gamgi net sung vuah amau’ khuom khawna tawh kizui-in a ten nading vua kipie munte tam teng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judah gam sunga Hebron le a kimvela om lononate amate tungah a pie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />ahi vangin Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb tungah khuopi-a lote le a khuotate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Aaron’ tapate tungah a pieh uh kibuhna khuopite: Hebron, Libnah le a lonona gamte tawh, Jattir, Eshtemoa le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hilen le a lonona gamte tawh, Debir le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ashan le a lonona gamte tawh, le Bethshemesh le a lonona gamte tawh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Benjamin minam panin Geba le a lonona gamte tawh, Alemeth le a lonona gamte tawh, le Anathoth le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi. Amau’ innkuon sung panin a khuopi zosie uh a unpi-in sawm le thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Kohath-te a omlai teng tungah aisanna tawh Manasseh minam alangte’ gam sung panin khuopi sawm kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Gershom tate kungah a innkuon zui-in Issachar-te’ gam, Asher-te’ gam, Naphtali-te’ gam, le Bashan-a om Manasseh-te’ gam sung panin khuopi sawm le thum kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Merari-te tungah a innkuon zui-in Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Zebulun-te sung panin khuopi sawm le ni kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel mite in Levi-te tungah khuopite le a lonona gam tawh a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Amate in Judah-te’ gam, Simeon-te’ gam, le Benjamin-te’ gam sung panin zong a min tawh kilo tami khuopite amate tungah a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kohath tapate’ innkuonte pawlkhat in Ephraim minamte’ gam sung panin khuopite a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Amate tunga kipie kibuhna khuopite: Ephraim muoltung gam sunga om Shechem le a lonona gamte tawh, Gezer le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon le a lonona gamte tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />le Manasseh minam alangte’ gam sung pan Aner le a lonona gamte tawh, le Bileam le a lonona gamte tawh ahi a, tam pen Kohath innkuon a omlaite ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Manasseh minam alangte’ gam sung panin Gershom-te tunga kipiete: Bashan gama Golan le a lonona gamte tawh le Ashtaroth le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Issachar-te’ gam sung pan: Kedesh le a lonona gamte tawh, Daberath le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramoth le a lonona gamte tawh, le Anem le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Asher-te’ gam sung panin: Mashal le a lonona gamte tawh, Abdon le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Naphtali-te’ gam sung pan: Galilee gam sunga om Kedesh le a lonona gamte tawh, Hammon le a lonona gamte tawh, le Kiriathaim le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Merari-te a omlai teng tunga Zebulun-te’ gam sung pana kipiete: Rimmono le a lonona gamte tawh, Tabor le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Reuben minamte gam sung panin Jordan nisuona lam, Jericho kung Jordan luigal langkhat sung panin: Pawn a om Bezer le a lonona tawh, Jahzah le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemoth le a lonona gamte tawh, le Mephaath le a lonona gamte tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />tuale Gad-te sung pan: Gilead gama om Ramoth le a lonona gamte tawh, Mahanaim le a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Heshbon le a lonona gamte tawh, le Jazer le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isaachar’ tapate: Tola, Puah, Jashub le Shimmon, li pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola’ tapate: Uzzi, Rephaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam, le Shemuel-te hi a, amau’ pupa innkuon sungah be lutangte ahi vua, Tola-te be pen amau’ khanggui-in mihat galhangte ahi uhi. David’ hun lai-in mihing tul sawmni le zaguh a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzzi’ tapa Izrahiah ahi hi. Izrahiah’ tapate: Michael, Obadiah, Joel, le Isshiah, mi nga ahi a, a unpi-un uhpite ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate tawh, a khanggui le a be a phung utawh kizui-in gal sim thei galkap hon mi tul sawmthum le tul guh a om hi. Azieh pen amate in zi tampi nei-in tapa tampi zong a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Issachar minam sunga om, khangsimna sunga kikhum, amau’ be galhang mi thahat a unpi-in tul sawmgiet le tul sagi pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjamin tapate: Bela, Becher, le Jediael, thum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela’ tapate: Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth, le Iri, nga a pha vua, pupa innkuon lutangte, a thahat galhangte ahi uhi; amau’ khangsimna sunga a kikhumna-ah tul sawmni le tulni le sawmthum le li pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Becher’ tapate: Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth, le Alemeth ahi uhi. Tam teng zosie pen Becher’ tapate ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale amau’ khanggui zui-in a khangsimna sunga a kikhumna-ah pupa innkuon lutangte, a thahat galhang mi tul sawmni le zani a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediael’ tapa Bilhan ahi hi. Bilhan’ tapate: Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Chenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish, le Ahishahar ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam teng a unpi-un Jediael’ tapate ahi vua, pupa innkuon lutangte a hina uh dung zui-in mihat galhang, gal sim dinga a baisa-a om mi tul sawm le tulsagi le zani pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Shuppim le Huppim pen Ir’ tapate ahi vua, Hushim pen Aher’ tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naphtali’ tapate: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer, le Shallum ahi a, Bilhah’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh’ tapate: A meinu Aram tawh a nei Asriel le Machir ahi hi; ama nu in Gilead’ pa Machir nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Machir in Huppim le Shuppim ading zi a lahpieh hi. A sanggamnu a min Maacah ahi hi. A nina nu’ min Zelophehad ahi hi; tuale Zelophehad in tanute nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Machir’ zi Maacah in ta khat nei a, ama in a min Peresh hisah hi; a sanggampa’ min Sheresh hi a, a tapate’ min Ulam le Rakem ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulam’ tapa Bedan ahi hi. Tam teng pen Manasseh’ tapa Machir’ tapa Gilead’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sanggamnu Hammolecheth in Ishhod, Abiezer, le Mahlah nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shemida’ tapate Ahian, Shechem, Likhi, le Aniam ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraim’ tapate: A tapa Shuthelah, a tapa Bered, a tapa Tahath, a tapa Eleadah, a tapa Tahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a tapa Zabad, a tapa Shuthelah, le a tapa Ezer le Elead ahi uhi. Amate kuonsuhin a gante uh a lahpieh ziehun, gam sunga a suoh Gad mite in amate na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale amau’ pa Ephraim ni tampi sung kap a, ama henem dingin a sanggamte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ephraim in a zi luppi a, ama gai-in tapa khat a nei hi; a inn sungah gimna a tun ziehin ama in a min Beriah a hisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tanu Sheerah ahi a, Beth-horon neinung tungnung le Uzzen-sheerah khuo a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rephah a kici tapa khat nei a, ama suonlehlahte: Reseph, a tapa Telah, a tapa Tahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a tapa Ladan, a tapa Ammihud, a tapa Elishama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a tapa Nun, a tapa Joshua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A neite ule a tenna uh Bethel le khuopite, le nisuona lamah Naaran, le nitumna lamah Gezer le a khuopite, Shechem le a khuopite, le Azzah le a khuopite ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh’ mite gamgi duong teng, Beth-shean le a khuopite, Taanach le a khuopite, Megiddo le a khuopite, Dor le a khuopite zong ahi uhi. Tam khuopite sungah Israel’ tapa Joseph’ tapate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher’ tapate: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, le a sanggamnu uh Serah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beriah’ tapate: Heber le Malchiel ahi a, Malchiel pen Birzaith’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Heber pen Japhlet, Shomer, Hotham, le a sanggamnu uh Shua’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Japhlet’ tapate: Pasach, Bimhal, le Ashvath ahi uhi. Tam teng Japhlet’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Shemer’ tapate: Ahi, Rohgah, Hubbah, le Aram ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A sanggampa Helem’ tapate: Zophah, Imna, Shelesh, le Amal ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zophah’ tapate: Suoh, Harnepher, Shual, Beri, Imrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran, le Beera ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jether’ tapate: Jephunneh, Pispa, le Ara ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ulla’ tapate: Arah, Hanniel, le Rizia ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tam teng zosie a unpi-un Asher’ sungkuon mite ahi vua, pupa innkuon lutangte, a kituomteel mihat galhangte, milien milalte ahi uhi. Gal sim dinga khangsimna sunga kikhum mihing tul sawmni le tulguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin pen a tacil Bela, a nina Ashbel, a thumna Aharah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a lina Nohah, le a ngana Rapha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bela’ tapate: Addar, Gera, Abihud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera, Shephuphan, le Huram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ehud’ tapate (amate pen Geba-a teng pupa innkuon lutangte ahi vua, amate Manahath ah salin kipuoh hi):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Naaman, Ahijah, le Uzza le Ahihud’ pa Heglam kici Gera ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Shaharaim in a zite Hushim le Baara a sawlmang zaw ciengin Moab gam sungah tapate nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zi Hodesh tawh a nei tapate: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuz, Sachia, le Mirmah. Tam teng a tapate ahi a, pupa innkuon lutangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Hushim tawh zong a nei uh tapate: Ahitub le Elpaal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elpaal’ tapate: Eber, Misham, le Ono le Lod le a khuopite tawh a sat Shemed,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />le Beriah le Shema (Gath khuo mite a taisah Aijalon-a teng pupa lutangte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />le Ahio, Shashak, le Jeremoth ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Michael, Ishpah, le Joha-te pen Beriah’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebadiah, Meshallum, Hizki, Heber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmerai, Izliah, le Jobab tam teng pen Elpaal’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakim, Zikri, Zabdi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaiah, Beraiah, le Shimrath-te pen Shimei’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdon, Zichri, Hanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Iphdeiah, le Penuel-te, tam teng Shashak’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaareshiah, Elijah, le Zichri-te pen Jeroham’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam teng pen a khanggui zui-a pupa innkuon lutangte, uhpite ahi vua, Jerusalem ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gibeon’ pa Jeiel pen Gibeon ah teng a, a zi’ min Maacah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tapa tapen Abdon, tua ciengin Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zecher,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />le Shimeah’ pa Mikloth ahi uhi. Tu-in a sanggamte zong Jerusalem-a a sanggamte galkhatah amau’ sanggamte ma tawh a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ner pen Kish’ pa, Kish pen Saul’ pa ahi a, Saul Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, le Esh-baal’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan’ tapa pen Meribbaal ahi hi; tuale Meribal pen Micah’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Micah’ tapate: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, le Ahaz ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahaz pen Jehoaddah’ pa ahi hi; tuale Jehoaddah pen Alemeth, Azmaveth, le Zimri’ pa ahi hi; Zimri pen Moza’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Moza pen Binea’ pa ahi hi; Binea’ tapa Raphah, a tapa Eleasah, a tapa Azel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azel in tapa guh nei a, a min uh pen: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan; tam teng zosie pen Azel’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azel’ sanggampa Eshek’ tapate: A tacil Ulam, a nina Jeush, le a thumna Elipheleti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulam’ tapate mihat galhangte, thal tawite, tu le ta tampi neite ahi vua, mi za le sawmnga pha uhi. A unpi-un Benjamin minamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n khangsimnate sungah Israel mi zosie kiciemte hi; tuale Israel Kumpite’ Laibu sungah tam teng kigiel hi. Amau’ thuman lona ziehin Babylon ah Judah salin kipeipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in ahile amau’ neisa amau’ khuopite sunga a tengkia masate pen Israel-te, siempute, Levi-te, le biehinnpi nasemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim, le Manasseh mi pawlkhat Jerusalem ah a teng uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah tapa Perez’ tapate lah panin Bani’ tapa Imri, a tapa Omri, a tapa Ammihud, a tapa Uthai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shilon-te lah panin: A tacil Asaiah le a tapate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerah’ tapate lah panin: Jeuel le a unaute zaguh le sawmkuo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin-te lah panin: Hassenuah’ tapa Hodaviah, a tapa Meshullam, a tapa Sallu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jeroham’ tapa Ibneiah, Machri’ tapa Uzzi, a tapa Elah, le Ibnijah’ tapa Reuel, a tapa Shephatiah, a tapa Meshullam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khanggui uh dung zui-in a sanggamte uh zakuo le sawmnga le guh pha hi. Tam teng pen pupa innkuon lutangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempute lah panin: Jedaih, Jehoiarib, Jachin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />le Ahitub’ tapa Meraioth, a tapa Zadok, a tapa meshullam, a tapa Hilkiah’ tapa Azariah, Pasien’ biehinn uhpipa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Malchijah’ tapa Pashhur, a tapa Jeroham, a tapa Adaiah, le Immer’ tapa Meshilemith, a tapa Meshullam, a tapa Jahzerah, a tapa Adiel, a tapa Maasai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau’ unaute banah a pupa innkuon lutangte, Pasien’ biehinn sunga nasem siem mi tulkhat le zasagi le sawmguh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi-te lah panin: Merari’ tapate sung pan Hashabiah, a tapa Azrikam, a tapa Hasshub, a tapa Shemaiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, le Asaph’ tapa Zikri, a tapa Mica, a tapa Mattaniah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeduthun’ tapa Galal, a tapa Shemaiah, a tapa Obadiah, Netophath khuotate-a teng, Elkanah’ tapa Asa, a tapa Berechiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kulpi tunkot cingte: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, le Ahiman ahi hi; tuale a sanggampa uh Shallum pen amau’ uhpi hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate pen nidangin kumpipa’ tunkot nisuona pang ngahin a om uhi. Tam teng pen Levi-te giephuola kotcingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau’ pu le pate pen biehbuh lutna mun a cing, Topa’ phuol uhte a na hi ma bangun, Korah’ tapa Ebiasaph, a tapa Kore, a tapa Shallum le ama’ pupa innkuonte’ sanggamte pen biehna nasepna a uh, puonbuh sangkil cingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Eleazar’ tapa phinehas pen a tawpsa hunin amahaw’ uhpipa hi a, Topa in ama a ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshelemaiah’ tapa Zechariah pen kikhopna puonbuh lutna kotcing pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kotcing dinga kiteel tam mite zosie a unpi-un zani le sawm le ni pha uhi. Amate ahile a khuota vua khangsimna-ah kisim uhi. David le thumu pa Samuel in tam panmun muonhuoite-ah amate na sudet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate le a suonlehlahte pen Topa’ biehinn kotte a uh le puonbuhte cingin a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kotpi cingte ahile a ningli tengah, nisuona, nitumna, leilu, le leitaw lamah a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuota sunga om a sanggamte uh ni sagi sielin amate tawh kiguol hlahin kotcing dingin a pei uh kul hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />bangzieh ahei Levi mi kotpi cing uhpi li teng pen innkhante le Pasien’ inn gougil koinate uh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale Pasien’ inn gei-ah amate a zan gie uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate tungah zingmawng sielin vil ding nasep le kot hon ding nasep kiguon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi kimkhat in nasepna-a kizang umlebeel vai sai uhi. Azieh pen tuate a kilah cieng le a kikoikia ciengin a phaza a sim ding uh a kisam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate lahah adang pawlkhatte pen topha sabuoite, vanzah siengthote, annelte, lenggazute, sathaute, gimnamtuite, le a namtui nate vil dingin kise hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siempute’ ta adangte in panamtui dingin gimnamtuite a hal ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Levi-te lahah Korah-te Shallum’ tacil Mattithiah in mohpheng bawlte a van hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kohath sanggamte pawlkhat in zong sabbath simin Ompina Anlum guolte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng pen lasate, Levi-te’ pupa innkuon lutangte, nasep dangte panin pengin biehinnpi innkhante sunga a tengte ahi uhi, azieh pen amate in sun le zanin na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ khanggui zui-a makaite, Levi-te’ pupa innkuon lutangte ahi uhi; Jerusalem ah amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gibeon-ah Gibeon’ pa Jeiel teng a, ama zi’ min Maacah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tacil Abdon hi a, tua ciengin Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, le Mikloth ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tuale Mikloth pen Shimeam’ pa ahi hi; tam teng zong a tanaute tawh Jerusalem ah kimaingatin a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ner pen Kish’ pa, Kish pen Saul’ pa ahi hi. Saul pen Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, le Eshbaal’ pa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tuale Jonathan’ tapa Meribbaal hi a, Meribal pen Micah’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Micah’ tapate: Pithon, Melech, Tahrea, le Ahaz;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tuale Ahaz pen Jarah’ pa hi a, Jarah pen Alemeth, Azmaveth, le Zimri’ pa ahi hi; tuale Zimri pen Moza’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moza pen Binea’ pa ahi hi; tuale a tapa Rephaiah, a tapa Eleasah, a tapa Azel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azel in tapa guh nei a, tuate’ min: Azrikam, Bokheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan ahi uhi; tam teng Azel’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistia-te in Israel a sim uhi; tuale Philistia-te mai-ah Israel mite tai-in Gilboa Muol tungah pua-in a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia-te in Saul le a tapate a pha uhi; tuale amate in Saul’ tapate ahi Jonathan, Abinadab le Malchishua te a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul in gal kidona nanha a sa mama hi. Tuale thal kapte in ama mu-in a kapliem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in a galvan puopa kungah, “Tam tep kitan lo mite hing pei-in ei apmaipi lo nadingun na namsau dawh inlen ei dawtlia in,” a ci hi. Hizongle a galvan puopa a zau ziehin a bawl nuom sih hi. Tuaci’n Saul in a namsau la-in tua tungah pua-in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A galvan puopa in Saul si a mu bepin ama zong a namsau tungah pua-in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangin Saul a si hi; ama le a tapa thumte le a innkuon zosie a siton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuom sunga om Israel mi zosie in galkapte taimangin Saul le a tapate a sina uh a mu ciengun khuopite nuasie-in a taimang uhi. Philistia-te pei-in tua khuopi teng a luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing cieng, a kithat mite’ puon hawhkhie dingin Philistia-te a pei uh ciengin Gilboa Muol tungah Saul le a tapate a sina a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in ama’ nate hawh dawhin a lutang le a galhiem a la vua, a milimte ule mite kungah tua lungdam thu a tangko dingin Philistia-te’ gam sung zosie-ah kamtaite a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a pasiente uh’ biehinn sungah ama’ galhiem koi-in Dagon biehinn sungah a lutang a suong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Philistia-te in Saul tunga a bawldan uh Jabesh-gilead mi zosie in a zah ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a thahat galhangte kithawi-in Saul le a tapate’ luonghawm la-in Jabesh ah a puo uhi. Tua ciengin Jabesh-a gangpi sing nei-ah amau’ gute a vui vua, ni sagi sung an a tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n a thuman lona ziehin Saul a si hi. A thupieh a zui lona ziehin Topa tungah ama a thuman lo a hi hi. Tua tham loin ama in dawilawm nei khat thu dong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa kung panin lamlahna sui lo hi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa ! in ama that a, Jessi’ tapa David tungah kumpi gam a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel zosie Hebron-a David kungah a kikhawm vua, “En in, kote na gu le na tel ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile masang lai-in, Saul kumpi ahi sung nangawnin Israel galkapte thu a pie nangma na hi hi. Topa na Pasien in nangma kungah tam bangin gen hi: Nang pen ka mi Israel-te a cingpa na hi ding a, ka mi Israel tungah a uhpa na hi ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel upa zosie Hebron-a kumpipa kungah pei-in David in Hebron-a Topa mai-ah amate tawh thuciemna khat a bawl hi. Samuel tungtawnin Topa’ thugen bangin amate in Israel kumpi dingin David sathau a nu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gam sung mi ahi Jebus-te tenna, Jebus a kici Jerusalem ah David le Israel mi zosie a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jebus-a tengte in David kungah, “Tam sungah nang pei sih ding hi,” a ci uhi. Hizongle David in tu-a David’ khuopi Zion mun muonhuoi a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in, “Jebus-te a sim masa popo uhpi le galkapmangpa hi ding hi,” a ci hi. Zeruiah’ tapa Joab kuonto masa a, ama galkapmang a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mun muonhuoi sungah David a teng hi; tua ahi ziehin tua khuo pen David’ khuopi kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Milo panin a kimvelah a kuolin khuopi lam hi. Joab in khuopi sunga a omlai mun teng a puokia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Pasien in ama ompi ahi ziehin David thupi semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng pen Israel tawh kisai-in Topa’ thugen bangin ama kumpi a suo thei nadingin, Israel zosie tawh ama’ kumpi gam sungah ama nahpitaha a panpi David’ galhangte’ uhpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam teng pen David’ mi thahat galhangte kiciemtena ahi hi: Hachmoni’ tapa Jashobeam pen mi thumte lahah a lamkai pa ahi hi; ama in a teipi lehin mi zathum do a, thakhatin a unin that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale mi thahat thumte lahah ama’ zomah Ahoh mi Dodo’ tapa Eleazar ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Philistia-te galbawl dingin tua munah a kikhop ciengun Pasdammim ah David tawh ama omton hi. Tua sungah mangbuham a dima pona leitang khat a om hi. Tu-in Philistia-te kung panin mite a taimang vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin ama le David in tua leitang laikim tahah panmun la-in hu a, Philistia-te that hi; tuale Topa in guolzawna lienpi tawh amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rephraim kuomah Philistia-te’ galkapte giephuol satin a op laitahun Adullam leihawm a David kungah uhpi sawmthumte lah panin mihing thum a kumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua laitahin mun muonhuoi sungah David a om hi; tuale Betleham khuo-ah Philistia khuocingte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in lunggulna tawh, “Aw, Bethlehem tunkot gei-a tuikhuh panin ka dawn ding tui mi khat in ei pie thei leh ci tei ing e!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Thumte in Philistia-te’ giephuol a phukeh vua, Bethlehem tunkot gei-a tui tawi-in David kungah a peipi uhi. Ahi vangin David in tua tui a dawn sih hi; ama in Topa adingin tua tui sungsuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in, “Tami tui ka dawn poma sih ding hi. Tam mite’ sisan ka dawn thei mawh ding amah? Bang ding ahei cile a luong uh khamin tami tui ang tawi uh ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tua ziehin ama in tua tui a dawn sih hi. Tua Thumte in tam bang teng a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Joab’ sanggampa Abishai pen Sawmthumte lahah a uhpi ahi hi. Ama in a teipi tawh mihing zathum do-in amate that a, tuaci’n mi Thumte banah min khat a ngabe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing Sawmthumte lahah ama a minthang pen hi a, tuaci’n amau’ lamkaipa a suoh hi. Ahi vangin ama in mi Thumte pha zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah pen Kabzeel khuomi galhang, sil thupite a bawlpa ahi hi; ama in Moab mi galhang ni that hi. Ama in vua kieh ni khatin leihawm sunga om humpi khat zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale ama in a thagol, tong nga a sang Egypt-te khat that hi. Tua Egypt mipa in a khutah siemgante’ siem lawngpi cie bang a pha teipi khat nei hi; ahi vangin ama do dingin ama kungah ciengkhut khat tawh Benaiah pei a, Egypt mipa’ khut panin a teipi lahpiehin ama’ teipi ma tawh ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam silte Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah’ bawl ahi a, tua galhang thumte banah min khat ngabe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama mihing Sawmthumte lahah a min kidawh a, ahih vangin mihing Thumte pha zo lo hi. David in ama cingte’ uhpa-in ama koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galkapte lah panin mi thahatte pen Joab’ sanggampa Asahel, Bethlehem-te Dodo’ tapa Elhanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Harod-te Shammoth, Pelon-te Helez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tekoa-te Ikkesh’ tapa Ira, Anathoth-te Abiezer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hushah-te Sibbekai, Ahoh-te Ilai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Netophah-te Maharai, Netophah-te Baanah’ tapa Heled,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin-te sung panin Gibeah-te Ribai’ tapa Ithai, Pirathon-te Benaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gaash luidung-te Hurai, Arbath-te Abiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bahurim-te Azmaveth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gizon-te Hashem, Harar-te Shagee’ tapa Jonathan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harar-te Sachar’ tapa Ahiam, Ur’ tapa Eliphal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mecherath-te Hepher, Pelon-te Ahijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Carmel-te Hezro, Ezbai’ tapa Naarai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nathan’ sanggampa Joel, Hagri’ tapa Mibhar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ammon-te Zelek, Zeruiah’ tapa Joab’ galhiem puopa Beeroth-te Naharai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ithri-te Ira le Gareb,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hit-te Uriah, Ahlai’ tapa Zabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Reuben-te’ makai khat ahi, Reuben-te Shiza’ tapa Adina, le ama tawh mihing sawmthum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Maacah’ tapa Hanan, Mithni-te Joshaphat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ashterath-te Uzzia, Aroer-te Hotham’ tapate Shama le Jeiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tiz-te Shimri’ tapa Jediael le a sanggampa Joha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mahavah-te Eliel, Elnaam’ tapate Jeribai le Joshaviah, Moab-te Ithmah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mezoba-te Eliel, Obed, le Jaasiel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kish’ tapa Saul ziehin David a nop bangin a tat thei lo laitahin Ziklah ah ama kunga a hawte tam teng ahi uhi; tam teng pen gal sungah ama a panpi mihat galhangte lahah mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate pen thalkap siem, le a khut zietlam le veilamah thaltang kap thei le suong sep theite ahi uhi; amate pen Saul’ sanggam Benjamin-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahiezer pen a uhpi ahi a, tua ciengin Joash ahi hi; a ni gelin Gibeah-te Shemaah’ tapate ahi uhi. Azmaveth’ tapate Jeiel le Pelet zong; Anathoth-te Berakah le Jehu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon-te Ishmaiah, mihing sawmthumte lahah galhangpa le mihing sawmthumte makaipa; Gederah-te Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan, le Jozabad;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Haruph-te Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, le Shephataiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Korah-te Elkanah, Isshiah, Azarel, Joezer, le Jashobeam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />le Gedor-te Jeroham’ tapate Joelah le Zebadiah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gad-te lah panin gamlah mun muonhuoi sunga David kungah a thahat a siem galhangte, lum le teikhaw a siem, a maitang uh humpi maitang tawh a kibang, le muoltung sakhi bangin a mallanga a peite:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A uhpi Ezer, a nina Obadiah, a thumna Eliab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a lina Mishmannah, a ngana Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a guhna Attai, a sagina Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a gietna Johanan, a kuona Elzabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a sawmna Jeremiah, a sawm le khatna Macbannai-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam Gad-te pen galkap uliente ahi vua, a neupen in galkap zakhat, a lienpen in galkap tulkhat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam teng pen a hla masa sungin Jordan gunpieu zosie tui a let laitahin Jordan galkai-in kuom sunga om mite nisuona lam le nitumna lama a taisah mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mun muonhuoi sunga David kung ah Benjamin-te le Judah-te pawlkhat a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate tawh a kimu dingin David kuonin amate kungah, “Lawmta hina tawh kei ei panpi dinga ang pei na hi uleh note tawh ka lungsim a kihuolton ding hi. Ahi vangin keima in bangma a sie bawl lo napi ka galte tungah kei ei leheh dinga ang pei na hi uleh, i pu i pate’ Pasien in hing mu hinlen, note thu hing khen taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi sawmthumte a uhpipa Amasai tungah hlagau tung a, ama in, David aw, ko nangma-’a ka hi uhi. Jessi’ tapa aw, nangma’ pawl hi ung! Nang tungah nopna om hinlen, nang ang panpite tungah zong nopna om taheh! Bang zieh ahei cile na Pasien in nang ang panpi hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin David in amate a sang a, ama’ galkap uliente a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Philistia-te tawh Saul sim dinga David a kuon laitahin Manasseh-te pawlkhat tai-in David a zop uhi. (Ahi vangin David in Philistia-te panpi lo hi; azieh pen Philistia a uhte kikumin, “A pupa Saul kungah ei taisan ding a, eima’ lu tungah ang tu ding hi,” a ci ziehun ama a sawldoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziklak ah a pei laitahin tam Manasseh sung panin tai-in ama a belte: Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu, le Zillethai hi a, Manasseh sungah mi a tulin a uhte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in misuomte a do David a panpi uhi. Azieh pen amate galhang mite ahi vua, galkap sungah galkap bute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien’ galkap bangin galkap hon tampi a phah dongin a panpi dingin David kungah a ni ni-in mite a lut bebe uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng pen Topa’ thugen tawh kizui-in Saul kumpipa’ gam David tungah a ap dingin Hebron-a ama kunga a pei galkap a khente’ phaza ahi uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah mite sung panin lum le tei tawi galkap tulguh le zagiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon-te sung panin a thahat galhang mihing tulsagi le zakhat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi-te sung panin mi tul li le zaguh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron’ innkuon sung panin makai Jehoiada, le ama tawh mi tulthum le zasagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Galhang tangval Zadok, le ama’ pupa innkuon sung panin galkapmang sawmni le nite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saul’ sanggamte ahi Benjamin-te tulthum ahi a, tuate lahah a tamzaw Saul’ innkuon lamah a pang na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ephraim-te sung panin a thahat galhang, a pupa uh’ innkuon sungah mi minthang, a madawh mi tul sawmni le zagiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Manasseh minam alangte sung panin David kumpi a suohsah dinga a pei a min kilo mihing tul sawm le tulgiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Issachar-te sung panin hun pei zie a theitel, Israel in bang sem leh kilawm ding ahei ci-a a thei uhpi zani le amau’ uhna nei-a om a sanggam zosie ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zebulun-te sung panin David panpi dinga lungkhat a khai galsim siemsa galkapte, galsim nading galvan zosie tawh a kivon galsim thei mi tul sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Naphtali-te sung panin galkapmang tulkhat le amate tawh a om lum le tei a tawi mi tul sawmthum le tulsagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dan-te sung panin gal sim dinga kiguong mi tul sawmni le tulgiet le zaguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asher-te sung panin gal sim dinga a baisa-a om galsim a siemsa galkap tul sawmli ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jordan galkhat a om Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alang panin galhiem namkim tawh a kivon mi tul zakhat le tul sawmni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tam teng zosie gal sim dinga kithawi galhangte ahi vua, Israel zosie tungah David kumpi-a a koi ding ngaisutna tahpi tawh Hebron ah a pei uhi; tua ma bangin a omlai Israel zosie zong David kumpi hisah ding a ngaisutna uh kikhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A sanggamte in amau adingin a na vaihawm ziehun amate tua munah David tawh ni thum sung anne tui dawnin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel gam sungah kipahna thu a op ziehin a kim a pamte ahi Issachar, Zebulun le Naphtali dong panin zong pei-in laate, kalaohte, le laa-sakolte le bawngtangte, an tampitah, thei mohte, lengga kiphogaw bawhte, le lenggazu le sathau, bawngtangte le tuute a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in a tul-a uhte, a za-a uhte le a makai zosie tawh thu kikupna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Israel a kikhawm zosie kungah, “Note in hoi na sah vua Topa i Pasien’ deina ahile eite kungah amate ang peiton thei nadingin Israel gam sung zosie-ah a omlai i sanggamte le lonona gam a nei khuopi sunga om siempute le Levi mite hlan dingin mi sawl vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin eima kungah i Pasien’ singkuong lakia vai; azieh pen Saul hun lai-in i don kha sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zosie in tua thu hoi sa uh ahi ziehin a kikhawm mi zosie in tua banga bawl dingin a thukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in Kiriath-jearim panin Pasien’ singkuong puo dingin Egypt-a Shihor panin Lebo-hamath cieng dong Israel mi zosie a khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum panin cherub-te’ tunga a to, ama’ min tawh a kilo Pasien’ singkuong a peipito dingin David le Israel mi zosie, Judah-a’ ahi Kiriath-jearim a kici Balaah ah a kuonto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abinadab’ inn panin leeng tha khat tungah Pasien’ singkuong puo-in Uzza le Ahio in tua leeng tha a hawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David le Israel mi zosie in late, lyre lasahna, harp lasahna, tawmte, daltuote, le pengkulte tumin a tha nei za utawh Pasien mai-ah a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chidon’ ancilna phuol a tun ciengun bawngtangte in singkuong lawthing ahi ziehin a khut zahin Uzza in tua singkuong a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uzziah tungah Topa a sin a so hi; ama in a khut tawh singkuong a thamkhah ziehin Topa in ama vatin tua mun Pasien mai-ah ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uzza tungah Topa’ thangpaina a pawh zah ziehin David a lungthah hi; tuaci’n tuni dongin khum mun Perez-uzzah kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni-in David in Pasien a giing hi; ama in, “Keima’ kep dingin Pasien’ singkuong bangci puoh thei ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in ama’ kep dingin David khuopi-ah tua singkuong a la sih hi. Ama in tua tangin Obed-edom’ inn ah Git-te a tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Obed-edom innkuon tawh Pasien’ singkuong hla thum sung om a, Topa in Obed-edom’ innkuon le a nei zosie thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tyre kumpipa Hiram in David ading inn khat lampieh dingin ama kungah kamtaite sawlin taamtah singluongte, leilesuong innlam siemte le khutsiemte a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Israel tunga kumpi dingin ama a kipsah lam le a mi Israel a khuolna ziehin, David in ama’ kumpi gam a kitawisang lam David in thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in Jerusalem ah zi nei be a, ama in tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jerusalem-a a nei a tate’ min ahi hi: Shammua, Shobab, le Nathan, Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, le Elpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elishama, Beeliada, le Eliphelet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi zosie tungah kumpi dingin David sathau a kinu lamtah Philistia-te in a zah ciengun David sui dingin Philistia mi zosie a kuonto uhi; tuale David in tua thu za-in amate sim dingin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in Philistia-te pei-in Rephaim kuom sung a bulu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in Pasien dong a, “Philistia-te do dingin ka kuonto diei mah? Ka khut sungah amate nei pie diei mah?” a ci hi. Topa in ama kungah, “Kuonto in, na khut sungah amate kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Baal-perazim ah David kuonto-in khum tahah amate a zo hi. David in, “Tuikhang in a phuhkhe bangin Pasien in keima’ khut tawh ka galte a phukhe ta hi,” a ci hi. Tua ziehin khum mun pen Baal-perazim kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in khum munah a pasien-te uh nuasie-in David’ thupiehna tawh tuate kihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Philistia-te kuonin kuom sung khatvei a bulukia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Pasien dongkia a, Pasien in ama kungah, “Amau’ nua-ah na kuonto sih ding hi; kuolpei inlen lungli kungte’ galkhat lam pan amate sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungli kungte dawnah kalsuon huging na zah ciengin gal sim dingin pei in; azieh pen Philistia galkapte vatmai dingin na mai-ah Pasien a kuon zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien’ thupieh bangin David gamta a, Gibeon panin Gezer cieng dong Philistia galkapte a vatmai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gam zosie-ah David’ minthanna kizel a, Topa in minam zosie tungah ama giinna a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in ama adingin David’ khuopi sungah innte lam a, ama in Pasien’ singkuong adingin mun khat siemin puonbuh khat a lampieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in amate, “ Topa’ singkuong a puo ding le kum tawna ama’ na a sem dingin a teelsa ahi ziehin Levi-te simlo koima in Topa’ singkuong puo thei lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a bawlsa ama om nading munah Topa’ singkuong a puoto dingin David in Jerusalem-a om Israel mi zosie khawmtuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Aaron le Levi suonlehlah a khopte:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohath tapate sung pan uhpi Uriel, a sanggamte mi za le sawmni tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Merari tapate sung pan uhpi Asaiah, a sanggamte mi zani le sawmni tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershom tapate sung pan uhpi Joel, a sanggamte mi za le sawmthum tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizaphan tapate sung pan uhpi Shemaiah, a sanggamte mi zani tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebron tapate sung pan uhpi Eliel, a sanggamte mi sawmgiet tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uzziel tapate sung pan uhpi Amminadab, a sanggamte mi za le sawm le ni tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in siempute Zadok le Abiathar, le Levi-te ahi Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel, le Amminadab hlanin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate kungah, “No pen Levi-te’ be lutangte na hi uhi; ama adinga ka bawlsa munah Topa’ singkuong na puohto thei nadingun noma le na sanggamte kisiensuo tawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in a masa lai-in na puoh lo ziehun Topa i Pasien uh’ lungthahna i tung vuah a pawhzah hi. Azieh pen eite in hoitahin i don sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel Pasien, Topa’ singkuong a puoto dingin siempute le Levi-te a kisiensuo tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ kammal tawh kizui-in Moses thupiehsa bangin Levi-te in a liengko vuah a zawlte tawh Topa’ singkuong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in kipahna aw a gin thei nadingin lasahna vanzahte, harp lasahna le lyre lasahnate le a daltuote tumin la sa dingin Levi uhpite kungah amau’ sanggamte a se nadingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Levi-te in Joel’ tapa Heman a se uhi; tuale a sanggamte sung panin Berechiah’ tapa Asaph, Merari minam sung sung panin a sanggamte uh Kushaiah’ tapa Ethan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale amate tawh a pawl nina-in Zechariah, Jaaziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, le Mikneiah, le kotcingte Obed-edom le Jeiel-te a se uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lasate ahi Heman, Asaph, le Ethan-te in sumngo daltuote a tum ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zechariah, Aziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah, le Benaiah-te in a peisuoh aw-in harp lasahna a tum ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, Obed-edom, Jeil, le Azaziah -te in lyre lasahnate aw-un tawh makai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi-te sung panin la makaipa Chenaniah pen lasah a siem ziehin la hilin a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Berechiah le Elkanah-te pen singkuong adingin kotcingte ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shebaniah, Joshaphat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zechariah, Benaiah, le Eliezar-te pen siempute ahi vua, amate in Pasien’ singkuong mai-ah pengkulte a tum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Obed-edom’ inn panin lungdamna tawh Topa’ singkuong a puoto dingin David le Israel upate, le a tul uhte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo Levi-te pen Pasien in a panpi ziehin amate in bawngtang sagi le tuutang sagi tawh biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David in puontuolpi hoi khat sil a , tua ma bangin singkuong a puo Levi-te zosie, lasate, le lasate makai Chenaniah-te in zong a sil uhi; tuale David in siempu puon khat sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel mi zosie in saki, pengkulte, le daltuo gingte tawh kituohin awngin Topa’ Thuciemna Singkuong peipi to-in harp lasahnate le lyre lasahnate tawh nahpitahin la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David khuopi sungah Topa’ Thuciemna Singkuong a tun laitahin, tawlet panin Saul’ tanu Michal a khuodah leh Kumpi David lamin diengin a op lam mu hi; tuale ama in a lungsim sungah ama a nau-et hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ singkuong a sung tumpi vua, David in ama adinga a lam puonbuh sungah a koi uhi; tuale amate in Pasien mai-ah meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate a pieh zaw ciengin Topa’ min tawh mite thupha a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale ama in Israel mi zosie tungah numei le pasal a kibangin, anlum khat, sa tanh khat, le lenggagaw khat ciet a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ singkuong mai-ah na a sem ding, thu a ngen ding, lungdam a ko ding, le Israel Pasien, Topa a pawh dingin Levi-te pawlkhat se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A makaipi Asaph, a nina-ah harp lasahnate le lyre lasahnate a tum ding pen Zachariah, Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed-edom, le Jeiel-te ahi uhi; Asaph in daltuote tum ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale siempute ahi Benaiah le Jehaziel in a hunhunin Pasien’ thuciemna singkuong mai-ah pengkul mut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in khum ni-in Topa tunga lungdamna la sa dingin Asaph le a sanggamte nasep a guon masa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa kungah nuom thu tut un, ama’ min lo unlen, ama’ nasep teng mite lahah kitheisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama kungah la sa un, ama pawhna la sa unlen, a lamdang a sepnate zosie mite kungah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A min siengtho sungah kisathei unlen; Topa a suite’ lungsim nuom taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa le a thahatna sui unlen, ama’ ompina sui zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama’ sepsa a lamdangte, ama’ na lamdang bawlte le a genkhiet a thukhennate phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nasem Israel’ suonte, a teeltuom Jacob’ tate aw phawh gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama pen eite’ Topa Pasien ahi a, leitung muncin tengah a thukhennate a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keima in gouluo-a na tanh dingin Canaan gam kang pie ding hi,” ci-in, Abraham tawh a bawl a thuciemna, Isaac tungah kiciemin a kam khap, Jacob tungah thukham bang le Israel tungah tawntung thuciemna banga a suhkip, khang tulkhat dong adinga a thupieh a kammalte phawh zing un. Amate tawmno khat ahi vua, khum gam sungah a kisim tham lo khuolmi ahi lai-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />gam khat pan gam khat, kumpi gam khat pan adang khatah a vavaih lai-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amate koima’ gawt ding phal loin amate vangin kumpite hosie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka sathau nusa mite khoikha sih unlen, ka kamsangte zong bangma law sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leisiet mi zosie aw, Topa tungah la sa un. Ni khat zaw ni khat ama’ hutdamna thu sutsut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minamte lahah ama’ minthanna gen unlen, a lamdang ama’ nasepte mi zosie lahah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile Topa lien mama a, ama nahpi taha pawh ding ahi hi; ama pen pasien-te zosie sangin zatah zawh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile mite’ pasien-te ahile milim kikheng ahi bo a, hizongle Topa in vantungte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama’ masangah patawina le thupina om a; thahatna le kipahna in ama’ munah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Minamte innkuonte aw, Topa tungah minthanna le thahatna pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nga ding kilawm minthanna Topa tungah pie un; biehna peipi unlen, ama mai-ah pei un. Puon siengtho silin Topa bie un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />leitung mi zosie aw, ama mai-ah citun un. Leitung kisukip a, kikhin ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vantungte lungdam hinlen, leitung zong kipah taheh. Amate in minamte lahah, “ Topa kumpi hi!” ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuipi le a sunga om teng hawh vapo uh hinlen; gamlah le a sunga om zosie lungdam kipah ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin gamlah singte kipahin Topa’ mai-ah la sa ding uhi. Azieh pen leitung thukhen dingin ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ko un; azieh pen ama hoi hi; bang zieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Ka hundampa uh Pasien aw, kote ei hundam inlen, minamte lah panin ei kaikhawmin ei hunkhie in. Na min siengtho tungah lungdam kang ko thei nading ule, nangma phatna-ah ka kisah thei nadingun kote ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa in a tawntung panin a tawntung dongin thupha nga taheh, zong ci un,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin mi zosie in “Amen!” ci-in Topa a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David in a kisam bangin singkuong mai-ah nisiela na sem dingin Topa’ thuciemna singkuong mai-ah Asaph le a unaute nuasie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed-edom le ama’ unau mi sawmguh le giet zong nuasie hi. Jeduthun’ tapa Obed-edom le Hosah-te pen kotcing dingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ thukham sunga kigiel zosie bangin Israel a thupiehsa tawh kizui-in, zingmawng nitahin meihal biehna maitam tungah Topa adinga meihal biehnate a pie den dingin Gibeon-a om munsang ahi Topa’ biehbuh mai-ah siempu Zadok le a sanggam siempute a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate tawh Heman le Jeduthun zong om a, ama’ itna kip kumtawnin a op ziehin Topa kungah kipahna thu tut dinga kiteel, a min tawh a kilo midangte omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Heman le Jeduthun in la-aw dingin pengkulte le daltuote a nei vua, la siengtho sah nading lasahna vanzahte zong a nei uhi. Jeduthun’ tapate tunkot cing dingin kise hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi zosie a inn lam ciet vuah pei-in a kikhen vua, David zong a innkuonpite thupha pie dingin a inn lamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in David a inn ah a ten cieng in ama in kamsang Nathan kungah, “Taamtah inn sungah kei ka teng a, hinanle Topa’ Thuciemna Singkuong puonbuh nei-ah a om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nathan in David kungah, “Pasien in nang hing ompi ahi ziehin na lungsim sunga om zosie bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua zan ma-in Nathan kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pei inlen, ka nasempa David kungah tam bangin gen in: Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Nangma in keima’ ten nading biehinn na lam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel ka peipi ni-a kipanin tuni dong biehinn sungah ka teng sih a, hinanle puonbuh sung le biehbuh sungah ka teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi zosie lahah ka kikhinna popo-ah ka mite a cing dinga thu ka pieh Israel thukhente khatpo kungah, “Bang dingin taamtah biehinn khat keima dingin ei lampieh lo na hei?” ci-in kam khat beh ka gen ngai ta amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ka nasempa David kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tuuhonte na zuina panin ka mi Israel tunga uhpa ahi dingin lonona panin nangma kang la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale na peina popo-ah nang kang ompi zo ta a, na mai-ah na galte zosie ka sumaimang hi. Tuale leitunga miliente khat min bangin nang adingin min khat kang bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mi Israel adingin mun khat ka se ding a, a mun ciet vuah a ten thei nadingun amate ka phut ding hi; tuale nidang lai-a migilote bawl bangin bawl nawn loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka mi Israel tungah thukhente ka koi huna kipanin amate a thanemsah nawn sih ding uhi; keima in na gal zosie uh ka zogawp ding hi. Tua tham loin Topa in na inn ding ang lampieh ding hi, ci-in nang tungah kang pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hinkhuo tawpin na pu na pate tawh na opton ciengin keima in nangma’ nua-ah na tapate khat ka khangsah ding a, na kumpi gam ka sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in keima adingin biehinn khat ei lampieh ding a, keima in a kumpi topha ka phut den ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei ama’ pa ka hi ding a, ama keima’ tapa ahi ding hi. Nangma masanga a sempa kung panin ka itna kip ka lahdawh bangin ama kung panin ka ladawh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka inn sung le ka kumpi gam sungah ama ka sukip ding a, a kum tawnin a kumpi topha kip den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami kammal zosie le tami kihilna zosie dung zui-in Nathan in David kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi David sungtumin Topa mai-ah to a, “ Topa Pasien aw, nang in tam cieng donga nei tunpi dingin kei koi ka hi a, ka innkuonte bang ahi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma’ muna-ah tami khu thu neuno khat ahi lel bo hi; nangma in hun sawtpi khat cienga ang tung ding na nasempa’ innsung thu tawh kisai zong na gen zo ta hi. Nangma in keima mi thupi khat bangin nei ngaisun hi, Topa Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na nasempa na patawina ziehin David in nang tungah bang ang gen be thei lai ding ahei? Na nasempa nangma in na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa aw, na nasempa na khuolna le nangma’ lungsim bangin tam nasep lienpi zosie na bawl zo ta a, tam na lienpite zosie na kitheisah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka bil utawh ka zah uh dung zui-in, Topa aw, nangma tawh a kibang koima a om sih a, nangma simlo Pasien dang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt pana na tatkhiet na mite mai-ah minamte notmangin nangma adingin a lien a zauhuoi min khat na bawlna, Pasien pei-in ama’ mi dinga a tatkhiet na mi Israel tawh a kibang leitungah minam dang koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mi Israel-te kumtawna nangma’ mi ahi dingin na bawl hi; tuale Topa aw, nang pen amau’ Pasien na suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuale tu-in, Topa aw, na nasempa le a innsung tungtang thu na gensa thu khantawnin kip hinlen, na khapsa bangin hing bawl ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bangin, ‘Israel Pasien, Vanglien Topa khu Israel-te’ Pasien hi,’ ci-in khantawnin na min kisuhkipin kiliensah zing ding hi; tuale nangma mai-ah na nasempa David’ innkuonte kisukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma ka Pasien in na nasempa adingin biehinn khat na lampieh ding ama tungah na lah zo ta hi. Tua ahi ziehin na nasempa in nangma mai-ah thu nget thei dingin ang mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale tu-in Topa aw, nang Pasien na hi a, na nasempa kungah tami sil hoi na kamciem zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin nangma mai-ah na nasempa’ innkuonte kumtawnin a om zing thei nadingin thupha na pieh ding hing lungkim in. Azieh pen Topa aw, na thupha piehte kumtawna thupha nga ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun phabep khat zaw ciengin David in Philistia-te simin amate a zo hi; ama in Philistia-te kung panin Gath le a khuoneute a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Moab-te zo a, Moab-te David’ nasem suohin sieh le kaih a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Euphrates gunah gamgi phut dingin Hamath lam manaw-in Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer a pei ciengin David in ama na do-in a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in ama kung panin leeng galkap tulkhat, sakol galkap tulsagi, le lei galkap tul sawmni a la hi. David in leengkai sakolte zosie’ kapzahui a atsanpieh a, hinanle leeng zakhat kai khop ding a hen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer a panpi dingin Damascus-ah Aram-te a pei ciengin David in Aram-te tul sawmni le tulni that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Aram gam Damascus ah khuocingte koi hi; tuale Aram-te pen David’ nasem suohin sieh le kaih a puoh uhi. Topa in David a peina popo-ah guolzawna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Hadadezer’ nasemte in a puoh kham lumte la-in Jerusalem ah peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezer’ khuopite ahi Tibhath le Cun panin David in sumngo tampi tah la hi; Solomon in tuate tawh sumngo tuikuongpi, khuompite, le sumngo umlebeelte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer’ galkap buppi a zawna thu Hamath kumpipa Tou in a zah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama in Hadadezer simin a zaw ziehin ama a hopi ding le a kipahpi dingin Kumpi David kungah a tapa Hadoram a sawl hi. Tu-in Hadadezer le Tou gal kido thei zel uhi. Ama in kham, ngun, le sumngo tawh a kibawl na namkim puoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kumpi David in Edom, Moab, Ammon-te, Philistia-te, le Amalek, minam zosie kung panin a puoh ngun le khamte tawh Topa kungah tam teng zong a apton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai in Ci Kuompi ah Edom-te tul sawm le tulgiet that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Edom ah khuocingte koi hi; tuale Edom-te zosie David’ nasem a suoh uhi. Topa in a peina popo-ah David guolzawna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel mi zosie tungah David a maang hi; tuale ama in ama’ mi zosie tungah thuman le thutang tawh vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Joab pen galkap makai ahi hi; Ahilud’ tapa Jehoshaphat pen thuciemte pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahitub’ tapa Zadok le Abiathar’ tapa Ahimelech pen siempute ahi vua, Shavsha pen thuvanpi pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah pen Chereth-te le Peleth-te tunga a uh ahi uhi; tuale David’ tapate pen kumpipa’ nasepna ah ulien pente ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun phabep zaw ciengin Ammon- te’ Kumpipa Nahash si a, a tapa in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in, “Ka tunga a pa ang thuman gamtat ziehin Nahash’ tapa Hanun tungah thumanin ka gamta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David in a pa vai tawh kisai-in ama a henem dingin kamtaite a sawl hi. David’ nasemte ama henem dingin Ammon-te’ gam Hanun kungah a pei ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon-te’ uliente in Hanun kungah, “David in na kungah mi henemte ang sawl ziehin na pa a patawi hi, ci-in na ngaisun amah? Gam sung a phetlet ding, a lumlet ding le a endap dinga nangma kunga a nasemte ang pei hi lel lo uh amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hanun in David’ nasemte man a, a khamul uh heukieupiehin a pheizum laikim cieng vuah a puon uh tansanin amate a sawlmang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale amate a pei uhi. David kungah tam mite thu a kigen ciengin ama in amate kungah kamtaite a sawl hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tua mite nahpitahin maizum uhi. Kumpipa in, “Na khamul uh a saukia masang Jericho ah hing om phot tadi unlen, tua ciengin hing kilekia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David’ muda thei dinga Ammon-te a kibawltawmna uh amau le amau a kimu ciengun Mesopotamia, Aram-maacah, le Zobah-te panin leeng galkapte guoi nadingin Hanun le Ammon-te in ngun talent tulkhat a hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in leeng galkap tul sawmthum le tulni le a galkapte tawh Maacah kumpipa a ciel vua, amate pei-in Medeba khuo mai-ah giephuol a sat uhi. A khuopi panun Ammon-te kikhawmin gal sim dingin a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in tua thu a zah ciengin Joab le galkap galhang zosie a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ammon-te pusuohin khuopi lutna-ah gal do dingin a kiguol vua, tuaci’n a kuon kumpite in gamlahah panmun a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joab in ama sim dinga a mai le a nua-a a kiguol galte a mu ciengin ama in zong Israel mi teltuom pawlkhat teel a, Aram-te sim dingin a kiguolsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in a omlai a galkapte a sanggampa Abishai in uhsah a, Ammon-te do dingin a kiguol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei adinga Aram-te a hat seng uleh nang in kei nei hu ding a, hizongle nang adinga Ammon-te a hat seng uleh ke’n nang kang hu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kihatsah inlen, i mite ading le i Pasien’ khuopite adingin hangsan vai; Topa in hoi a sah bangin hing bawl taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joab le ama kunga om galkapte in gal kido dingin Aram-te lam a nai uhi; tuale amate zong ama mai-ah a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aram-te a taimang uh Ammon-te in a mu ciengun, tua bang ma-in amate Joab’ sanggampa Abishai mai-ah a tai vua, khuopi sung a lut uhi. Tua ciengin Jerusalem ah Joab a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle Aram-te in Israel-te a lel lam a kithei ciengun amate in zong kamtaite sawlin Euphrates galkhat a om Aram-te a peipi vua, amau’ makai dingin Hadadezer’ galkapmangpa Shophach a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David kungah tami thu a kigen ciengin ama in Israel zosie kaikhawmin Jordan galkai a, a kung vuah pei-in amate tawh kisi dingin a galkapte a khawm hi. Aram-te do dingin David in amate kiguolsah a, amate in ama a do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mai-ah Aram-te a taimang uhi; tuiale David in Aram’ leenghawl galkap mi tulsagi, le lei galkap tul sawmli that a, a galkapmangpa Shophak zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadadezer’ nasemte in Israel a lel lam uh a kithei ciengun, David tawh kilemna bawlin a khut nei mi a suoh uhi. Tuaci’n Aram-te in Ammon-te a hu nuom nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum kum khuokhal sungin gal sim dingin kumpite a kuon hunin Joab in galkapte pui-in Ammon-te’ gam a susie vua, tuale pei-in Rabbah a imtawm uhi. Hinanle Jerusalem ah David a om hi. Joab in Rabbah simin a thalpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in ama’ lu tung panin Milcom’ kumpi lukhu a lahpieh hi; tua lukhu pen kham talent khat gih a, a sungah suong manpha khat a op lam ama in thei hi; tuale ama in tua lukhu David a khusah hi. Ama in khuopi sunga van kinuasie tampite zong peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in tua sunga om mite a peipi a, sing-atte, tuzumte, le heite tawh na sem dingin amate koi hi. Ammon-te’ khuopi zosie-ah tua bangin David in a bawl hi. Tua ciengin David le mi zosie Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Gezer ah Philistia-te tawh gal dona om hi; tua ciengin Hushath-te Sibbecai in migolte’ suonlehlahte khat ahi Sippai that hi; tuale ama in a khut nei-ah Philistia-te koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philistia-te tawh khatvei kidona omkia hi; tuale Jair’ tapa Elhanan in a teipi kung siemgante’ siemlawngpi cie a pha Git-te Goliath’ sanggampa Lahmi that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khut lang tuohah khutme guh le a keng lang tuohah kengme guh, a unpi-a sawmni le li a nei, mi thagol khat a opna Gath ah gal a omkia hi; ama zong mi thagolte’ hlahlesuon khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Israel a tawh ciengin David’ sanggampa Shimea’ tapa Jonathan in ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam teng Gath-a mi thagolte’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi; amate pen David le a nasemte’ khutlum tawh a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te do dingin Satan ding a, tuale Israel mi phaza sim dingin David hantawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in Joab le galkapmang teng kungah, “Pei un, Beer-sheba pan Dan cieng dong Israel-te va sim ta unlen, bangza pha uh ahei ci ka thei nadingin ka kungah ei zasah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joab in, “ Topa in a mite a za zakhatin khangsah taheh! Ka pu kumpipa aw, amate a unpi-un ka pu’ nasemte hi lo uh amah? Tua ahile bang dinga ka pu in tami kisam na sah ahei? Bang dingin Israel tungah mawna tun ding na hi ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa thugen in Joab a zothaw zaw hi. Tuaci’n Joab dingin Israel gamsung zosie tuon suohin pei a, Jerusalem ah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joab in mipi kisimna phaza a unpi-in David kungah a pie hi. Israel buppi sungah namsau tawi mi awn khat le sang khat om a, Judah sungah namsau tawi mi tul zali le tul sawmsagi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joab in a mi simna ah Levi le Benjamin halkha lo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama in kumpipa’ thupieh pen kidahhuoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin tami thu-ah Pasien lungkim lo a, ama in Israel a vatgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Pasien kungah, “Tami ka bawlna-ah ka khiel seng ta hi. Ahi vangin nangma kungah tu-in kang tau hi, na nasempa’ mawnate lamang ta’n; azieh pen mothuoitahin ka gamta zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in David’ thumu pa Gad kungah thu gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pei inlen David kungah, ‘ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Nangma tungah thu thum kang pie hi. Nangma tunga ka bawl ding tuate lahah khat teel in, ci hi,’ va ci tan,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n David kungah Gad haw a, ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi, ‘Na dei pen teel in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum thum sung kielpi ang tun nading; ahi sihle na galte’ namsau in ang nuaphah laitahin na galte in hla thum sung ang suhsiet nading; ahi sihle gam sungah pul natna ang tun nading, Topa’ vantungmi in Israel gam sung teng zosie-ah ni thum sung ang suhsiet nading Topa’ namsau,’ ci hi. Keima ei sawlpa kungah bangci dawnkia ding ka hei, tu-in khensat in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Gad kungah, “Ka lung a nah gim mama hi; a hepina lien mama ahi ziehin Topa’ khut sungah ei puasah in; ahi vangin mihing’ khut sungah ei puasah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Israel tungah pul natna tungsah a, Israel mi tul sawmsagi a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem a susie dingin Pasien in vantungmi khat sawl hi; ahi vangin a suhsiet kuon ciengin Topa in phawhkha a, tua tuosietna tawh kisai-in a lungsim khiem hi; ama in a susie vantungmi kungah, “Pha zo ta! Na khut ladawh ta’n,” a ci hi. Tua laitahin Jebus-te Ornan’ ancilna gei-ah Topa’ vantungmi a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David a khuodah leh leitung le vantung kikalah Topa’ vantungmi ding a, ama’ khut sungah namsau khat dawhsa-in Jerusalem tung lamah a khut zam a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale David in Pasien kungah, “Mite sim dinga thu a pie pa keima hi lo ka mah? Mawna bawlin a gitlo gamtat mama pa khu keima ka hi hi; ahi vangin tami tuute in bang bawlkhiel nei uh ahei? Topa ka Pasien aw, kang thum hi, keima le ka innkuonte ei gawt zaw inlen, na mite tungah pul natna hing tungsah sin!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi in Gad kungah David va peito hinlen Jebus-te Ornan’ ancilna phuolah Topa ading maitam khat lampieh heh ci-in a gen dingin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ min tawh a gen Gad’ thuhilna bang zui-in David a kuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ornan a kinua hei leh tua vantungmi mu hi; tuale ama tawh a omton a tapa lite a kiphuol vua, Ornan in a ancil maban a zom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ornan kungah David a tun ciengin Ornan khuodah a, tuale David a mu hi; a ancilna panin ama pusuohin a mai tuolkunin David tungah zatahna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in Ornan kungah, “Mite sung panin pul natna a ven thei nadingin Topa adingin maitam khat ka lam nadingin na ancilna mun ei pie in. A manza a kimtahin la inlen ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ornan in David kungah, “Kilah in; ka pu kumpipa in hoi na sah bangin bawl in; en in, keima in meihal biehnate-a zah ding bawngtangte, a sing ding ancilna singte, le an tawh biehna dingin mangbute a unpi-in kang pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kumpi David in Ornan kungah, “Hi lo hi, a manza a kimin pie-in kang lei ding ahi bo hi. Topa adingin nangma-a’ ka la sih ding a, keima sum tawp loin meihal biehnate zong ka pie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in a mun lei nadingin Ornan tungah kham shekel zaguh a gih a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David in khum munah Topa adingin maitam khat lam a, meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate a pie hi. Ama in Topa kungah thu ngen a, vantung panin meihal biehna maitam tungah mei tawh ama a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in vantungmi thupie a, a pai sungah a namsau a sietkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua hunin Jebus-te Ornan’ ancilna phuolah Topa in ama’ thungetna a dawn lam David in a mu ciengin ama in zong tua munah biehpiehna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gamlahah Moses in a na bawlsa Topa’ biehbuh le meihal biehna maitam pen khum hunin Gibeon muol vumah a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hizongle Topa’ vantungmi’ namsau giing ahi ziehin Pasien dong dingin tua munah David pei ngam lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in, “Tam munah Topa Pasien’ biehinn om ding a, tam munah Israel mite’ meihal biehna maitam om ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Israel gam sunga om gamdang mite a kikaikhop nadingun thu pie a, Pasien’ biehinn lam nading a kikhengsa suongte bawl dingin suongkhengte a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in tunkot kotkhah-a zah dingin siatuhkil le a kil nading sia tampi koi-in, a kite zo lo sumngo tampi zong a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Taamtah singte a phaza simzawh hi lo hi; azieh pen Sidon-te le Tyre-te in David kungah taamtah tampi tah a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile David in, “Ka tapa Solomon pen naupang lai-in bangma a thei nai sih a, Topa adinga kilam ding biehinn pen lah thupi-in gamcin tengah minthangin a vangnei ding ahi hi; tua ahi ziehin tuami adingin keima ka kigingkhol ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David a si masangin na tampitah a koikhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a tapa Solomon hlan a, Israel Pasien, Topa adingin biehinn khat lam nading thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Solomon kungah, “Ka ta aw, Topa ka Pasien’ min dingin biehinn khat lam ding ka gel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung a, ‘Nangma in sisan na tam luonsah zo ta a, gal lienpi na do zo hi; nang in ka min dingin biehinn na lam sih ding hi, azieh pen keima muna leitungah sisan tampi na luongsah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En in, nangma sung panin tapa khat ang pieng ding hi; ama pen kilemna mi hi ding hi. Keima in a kimvela a om galte sung panin ama kilemna ka pie ding hi; azieh pen ama’ min Solomon hi ding a, ama’ hun sungin Israel tungah kilemna le daina ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ka min dingin biehinn khat a lam ding hi. Ama ka tapa hi ding a, kei ama’ pa ka hi ding hi; Israel sungah ama’ kumpi topha ka kipsah peisuoh ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in ka ta aw, ama in nang tawh kisai a gensa bangin Topa na Pasien’ biehinn lamna-ah na lawcin thei nadingin Topa in nangma hing ompi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Israel tungah thuneina ang pieh ciengin Topa na Pasien’ thukham na zui thei nadingin Topa in nangma tungah thukhen siemna pilna le thu theitelna hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel adinga Topa in Moses kungah a pieh thukhamte le biehna ngaina kipte na zui siem nah leh na maa a vang ding hi. Thakhauh inlen hang in. Zau malmal sinlen lungkie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn dinga keima in gim le tawl thuohin kham talent tul zakhat, ngun talent awn khat, le a kite zo lo sumngo le siate ka koi zo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tuate khu a tam mama a, keima in note single suongte zong kang pie zo hi; nangma in tam teng na belap ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangma in nasem mi tampi na nei hi: Suongkhengte, leilesuong innlam siemte, khutsiemte, le sim zawh lo siemna nam zosie a nei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kham, ngun, sumngo, le sia nasep siemte na nei ding hi. Tu-in na sep kipan in. Topa in hing ompi taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in a tapa Solomon a panpi dingin Israel makai zosie thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Topa na Pasien uh note tawh hing om hi lo amah? Ama in na kimvel zosie vuah kilemna hing pie hi lo amah? Azieh pen keima’ khut sungah gam sunga teng mite ei pie zo hi; tuale Topa le a mite mai-ah tua gam kizo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in Topa na Pasien uh a sui dingin na lungsim ule na lungtang uh kipsah un. Topa’ min dinga kilam biehinn sungah Topa’ thuciemna singkuong le Pasien’ vanzah siengthote a kipeipi thei nadingin pei unlen Topa Pasien’ biehinn lam un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David vuoi-in kum tampi a phah ciengin Israel tungah kumpi dingin a tapa Solomon koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Israel makai zosie le siempute le Levi-te a kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi-te kum sawmthum pan a tungsie teng kisim a, a kigawm mi tul sawmthum le tulgiet pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in, “Tam teng sung panin tul sawmni le tul li in Topa’ biehinn sung nasep uh ding a, tulguhte pen uliente le thukhente ahi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tul li pen kotcingte hi-in, tul li in ama phat nadinga ka bawlsa tumtheite tawh Topa tungah phatna pie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Levi tapate tawh kituohin amate tam bangin a pawlpawlin khen hi: Tuate pen Gershon pawl, Kohath pawl, le Merari pawl ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershon’ tapate pen Ladan le Shimei ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladan’ tapate: A uhpi Jehiel, le Zetham, le Joel, thum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shimei’ tapate: Shelomoth, Haziel, le Haran, thum pha uhi. Tam teng pen Ladan innkuonte’ lutangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Shimei’ tapate: Jahath, Zina, Jeush, le Beriah. Tam mihing li teng pen Shimei’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zahatha pen uhpi ahi a, Zizah a nina ahi hi; ahi vangin Jeush le Beriah in tapa tampi a nei sih vua, tuaci’n amate innkuon khat bangin kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohath’ tapate: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel, li pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amram’ tapate: Aaron le Moses ahi uhi. Ama le a tapate in Topa mai-ah khan tawnin biehna pie-in ama’ na semin, ama’ min tawh thupha a pieh zing thei nadingin a siengpen nate a ap dingin Aaron kituomkoi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin Pasien’ mipa Moses’ tapate, Levi minam lahah kisim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses’ tapate: Gershom le Eliezer ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gershom’ tapate lahah Shebuel a uhpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezer’ tapate: Rehabiah a uhpi ahi hi; Eliezer in tapa dang nei lo a, hinanle Rehabiah’ tapate pen a tam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izhar’ tapate: Shelomith a uhpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hebron’ tapate: Jeriah a uhpi, Amariah a nina, Jahaziel a thumna, le Jekameam a lina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uzziel’ tapate: Micah a uhpi, le Isshiah a nina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merari’ tapate: Mahli le Mushi ahi hi. Mahli’ tapate: Eleazar le Kish ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eleazar tapa nei loin si a, ahi vangin tanu beh a nei hi; amau’ tanau ahi Kish’ tapate in amate a tenpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mushi’ tapate: Mahli, Eder, le Jeremoth, thum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng pen Topa’ biehinn lam nasepna-ah a sem ding, kum sawmni pan a tungsie, a mimalin a mina mi phaza tawh kituohin a pupa uh’ innkuon zui-a kiciemte Levi’ suonte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen David in, “Israel Pasien, Topa in a mite tungah tawlngahna pie zo hi; tuale Jerusalem ah ama a om zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n Levi-te in biehbuh hile biehna nasep nadingin vanzah dingte hile puoh ngai nawn lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen David’ kam nukhia pen dung zui-in tam teng kum sawmni pan a tungsie Levi mi phaza hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hinanle amau’ nasep ding pen Topa’ biehinn nasepna-ah Aaron’ suon le hlahte a hu ding vua, biehinn tuolte le biehinn khante kemin, a siengtho ahi nate zosie sawp sieng ding, le Pasien’ biehinn nasepna-ah sep ding khat popo a sem ding uh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />anlum guolte, an tawh biehna ding annel, tol saw lo anpheng, a ki-em silpieh, sathau tawh a kihal silpieh, le a phaza ahi sihle a golna tena nasep zosie hu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in zingmawng sielin dingin lungdam ko-in, Topa a phat ding vua, nitah lamin tua bang ma-in bawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa kungah a kul le a poimaw dung zui-in sabbath nite, hladet nite, le pawi nite-ah meihal biehna a kipieh popo ciengin Topa mai-ah om zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua bangin amate in kikhopna puonbuh le mun siengtho kemin, Topa’ biehinn nasepna ah a tanaute uh ahi Aaron’ suonte a hu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Aaron’ suonle hlahte kisekhen dan ahi hi. Aaron’ tapate: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin amau’ pa a si masangin Nadab le Abihu a si a, tapate a nei sih uhi; tuaci’n Eleazar le Ithamar-te siempu a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in a nasepna vuah mawpuohna a kisena dung zui-in amate a se-in khen a, Eleazar’ tapate ahi Zadok le Ithamar’ tapate ahi Ahimelech-te tawh a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ithamar’ tapate lah sangin Eleazar’ tapate lahah uhpi a tam zawh ziehin Eleazar’ tapate lahah pupa innkuon lutang sawm le guh koi-in, Ithamar’ tapate sungah giet koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eleazar’ tapate le Ithamar’ tapate sungah munsiengtho ulien le Pasien’ ulien om tuoh uh ahi ziehin, amate unpi-in a kibangin aisanna tawh amate a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi-te Nethanel’ tapa laithei Shemaiah in kumpipa, uliente, siempu Zadok, Abiathar’ tapa Ahimelech, siempute le Levi-te’ pupa innkuon lutangte mai-ah amate ciemte hi; Eleazar’ dingin pupa innkuon khat, Ithamar dingin zong pupa innkuon khat ma kiteel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoiarib tungah aisanna masa pen, Jedaiah tungah a ni na,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Harim tungah a thumna, Seorim tungah a lina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Malchijah tungah a ngana, Mijamin tungah a guhna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hakkoz tungah a sagina, Abijah tungah a gietna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeshua tungah a kuona, Shecaniah tungah a sawmna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eliashib tungah a sawm le khatna, Jakim tungah a sawm le nina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huppah tungah a sawm le thumna, Jeshebeab tungah a sawm le lina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bilgah tungah a sawm le ngana, Immer tungah a sawm le guhna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezir tungah a sawm le sagina, Happizzez tungah a sawm le gietna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pethahiah tungah a sawm le kuona, Jehezkel tungah a sawm nina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jachin tungah a sawmni le khatna, Gamul tungah a sawmni le nina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Delaiah tungah a sawmni le thumna, Maaziah tungah a sawmni le lina tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa in ama a thupieh bangin a pupi uh Aaron in amate dinga a kipsahsa ngaina dung zui-in Topa’ biehinn sunga a lut dingin tam teng in amau’ nasep dinga kise nasep a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Levi’ tapa a omlai teng lahah: Amram’ tapate sung panin Shubael; Shubael’ tapate sung panin Jedeiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabiah-te sung panin: uhpi Isshiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izhar’ tapate sung panin Shelomoth; Shelomoth’ tapate sung panin Jahath ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebron’ tapate lahah: Jeriah a uhpi, Amariah a nina, Jahaziel a thumna, Jekameam a lina.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uzziel’ tapate lahah Micah; Micah’ tapate lahah Shamir ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Micah’ sanggampa Isshiah; Isshiah’ tapate sung panin Zechariah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Merari’ tapate lahah: Mahli, Mushi, le Jaaziah. Jaaziah’ tapate lahah: Beno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Merari’ tapate lahah: Beno, Shoham, Zaccur, le Ibri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahli’ sung panin Eleazar hi a, ama in tapa nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kish lahah: Kish’ tapate Jerahmeel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mushi’ tapate lahah: Mahli, Eder, le Jerimoth. Tam teng pen amau’ pupa innkuon dung zui-in Levi’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in zong a tanaute uh Aaron’ suonlehlahte ma bangin Kumpi David, Zadok, Ahimelech, le siempute le Levi-te’ pupa innkuon lutangte le a uhpipa le a sanggam a neu pen mai-ah ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David le galkap uliente in zong biehpiehna adingin lyre-te, harp-te, le daltuote tawh kam a sang ding Asaph, Heman, le Jeduthun-te’ tapate a tuomkoi uhi. Na semte le amau’ nasepte tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asaph’ tapate lah panin: Kumpipa’ lamkaina nei-a Pasien thu a gen Asaph’ makaina nei-ah Asaph’ tapate Zaccur, Joseph, Nethaniah, le Asharelah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthun’ lahah Jeduthun’ tapate: Lungdam kona le Topa phatna dinga lyre lasahna tawh thu a gen, a pa uh Jeduthun’ makaina nei-ah Gedalaih, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah, le Mattithiah, mi guh pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heman lah panin Heman’ tapate: Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel, Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, Romamti-ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, le Mehazioth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam teng zosie Pasien thuciemna bangin ama a tawisang ding ahi kumpipa’ thumu pa Heman’ tapate ahi uhi; azieh pen Pasien in Heman tungah tapa sawm le li le tanu thum a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate zosie pen a unpi-un Topa’ biehinn sungah daltuote, harp-te, le lyre tawh a pa uh’ makaina nei-ah tumging tumte ahi uhi. Asaph, Jeduthun, le Heman-te pen kumpipa’ thupiehna nei-ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate le a tanaute uh, Topa dinga lasahna lam a kisin, a unpi-un a siemsa mi zani le sawmgiet le giet a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale a neu a lien, sie le a sinte a kibangin amau’ nasep ding ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asaph dingin ai masa pen Joseph tungah tu hi; a nina Geladiah, le a sanggamte, le a tapate sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a thumna Zaccur, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a lina Izri, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a ngana Nethaniah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a guhna Bukkiah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a sagina Jesarelah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a gietna Jeshaiah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a kuona Mattaniah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a sawmna Shimei, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a sawm le khatna Azarel, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a sawm le nina Hashabiah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a sawm le thumna Shubael, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a sawm le lina Mattithiah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a sawm le ngana Jeremoth, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a sawm le guhna Hananiah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a sawm le sagina Joshbekashah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />a sawm le gietna Hanani, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a sawm le kuona Mallothi, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a sawmnina Eliathah, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A sawmni le khatna Hothir, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a sawmni le nina Giddalti, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A sawmni le thumna Mahazioth, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a sawm ni le lina Romamtiezer, a tapate, le a sanggamte sawm le ni tungah tu hi;
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kotcingte kisekhenna ahile: Korah-te, Asaph’ tapate lah panin Kore’ tapa Meshelemiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meshelemiah in tapate nei hi: A tacil Zechariah, a nina Jediael, a thumna Zebadiah, a lina Jathniel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a ngana Elam, a guhna Jehohanan, a sagina Eliehoenai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Obed-edom in tapate nei hi: A tacil Shemaiah, a nina Jehozabad, a thumna Joah, a lina Sachar, a ngana Nethanel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a guhna Ammiel, a sagina Issachar, a gietna Peullethai ahi hi; azieh pen Pasien in ama thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tapa Shemaiah sung panin zong a pupate’ innkuon sungah thunei vaihawm tapate a pieng hi, azieh pen amate siemna lien nei mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Shemaiah’ tapate: Othni, Rephael, Obed, le Elzabad-te ahi vua, siemna nei a sanggamte uh Elihu le Semachiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam teng zosie a unpi-in Obed-edom’ tapate le a sanggamte utawh, nasep nadinga siemna a nei mi picingte ahi uhi; Obed-edom sung panin mi sawmguh le ni pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meshelemaiah in siemna a nei tapate le sanggamte, sawm le giet nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Merari’ tapate sung panin Hosah in tapate nei hi; Shimri a uhpi ahi a, (ama tacil ahi sih vangin a pa in a uhpi-in ama a bawl hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkiah a nina, Tebaliah a thumna, Zechariah a lina ahi hi. Hosah’ tapate le a sanggamte zosie sawm le thum pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam kotcing kihawmkhente in amau’ makaite tawh kituohin a sanggamte uh’ sep bang lienin Topa’ biehinn sungah nasep ding tavuon nei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuale amate in a neu a lien a kibangin a pupa innkuon zui-in kotpi cin ding ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nisuona lam ading ai, Shelemaiah tungah tu hi. A tapa, a pilvang thu kikuppipa Zechariah adingin zong ai a san vua, leilu adingin ai pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Obed-edom adingin leilu lamah suoh a, a tapate tungah vankoina innkhan kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shuppim le Hosah dingin nitumna lam, katona lamlien Shallecheth tunkotah kie hi. Galvilte a kimaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nisielin nisuona lamah Levi-te guh, nisielin leilu lamah li, nisielin leitaw lamah li, le vankholna inn ah ni ni-in a om uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale nitumna lama lampi inn adingin a lampi-ah li omin a lampi inn ah ni a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam teng Korah-te le Merari’ tapate lahah kotcing sekhennate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi-te lahah Ahijah in Pasien’ biehinn goukholnate le a ki-ap letsong koinate uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ladan, Geshon’ tapate lahah khat, innkuon tampi pienna mi khat hi a, Jehiel innkuonte pen ama sung pana pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehiel’ tapa Zetham le a sanggampa Joel in Topa’ biehinn vanmanpha koinate a uh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amram-te, Izhar-te, Hebron-te, le Uzziel-te sung panin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses’ tapa Gershom, a tapa Shebuel pen vanmanpha koina-ah a uhpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sanggamte, Eliezer sung panin a tapa Rehabiah, a tapa Jeshaiah, a tapa Joram, a tapa Zichri, le a tapa Shelemoth ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam Shelamoth le a sanggamte in Kumpi David le innkuon lutangte, le a tul a za uh uliente, le galkapmangte in a apsa uh a ki-ap letsong kikoina mun zosie a uh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gal sunga a lah uh vante panin Topa’ biehinn puo nadinga a ki-ap letsongte amate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Shelomoth le a sanggamte in thumu pa Samuel, Kish’ tapa Saul, Ner’ tapa Abner, le Zeruiah’ tapa Joab in a apsa zosie le a ki-ap letsong zosie a kem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izhar-te sung panin Chenaniah le a tapate pen Israel adingin uliente le thukhen-te ahi vua, a pulam nasepnate-ah vaihawmin kise hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebron-te sung panin Hashabiah le a sanggamte, siemna a nei mi tulkhat le za sagi in Jordan nitumna lam Israel tungah Topa’ nasepna vannuoi le kumpipa’ nasepna-te a van uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron-te sung panin Jerijah pen Hebron-te’ uhpipa ahi hi. (David’ uh a kum sawm lina kumin khangthu ahi sihle innkuon thu kantelna kibawl a, Gilead gam sung Jazer ah amate sung panin siemna lien a nei mite kimukhie hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpi David in ama le a sanggamte, siemna nei mi tulni le zasagi, innkuon lutangte ahite pen Pasien tawh kisai na zosie le kumpipa vaite-ah Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte tungah a vil dingin kise hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam pen Israel mi, innkuon lutangte, a tul le a za-a a uhte, le khen khatah mi tul sawmni le tulli ta a pha, kum khat sung tawntung hla khat zaw hla khat vaitung le vaikuon dinga kise a khente tawh kisai-in na zosie-ah kumpipa’ na a sem a uliente uh’ min kikhumna ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hla masa sungin Zabdiel’ tapa Jashobeam pen a khen masa a uhpa ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama Perez’ suonlehlah ahi a, a hla masa sungin galkapmangte zosie’ a uhpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahoh-te Dodai pen a hla nina sunga a khen a uhpa ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hla thumna-a a khen thumna uhpa pen siempu Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen mi Sawmthumte sung panin a thahat, mi Sawmthumte a uh Benanaih ahi hi; a tapa Ammizabad pen ama’ khen uhpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hla lina-a a lina pa pen Joab sanggampa Asahel ahi a, ama zaw ciengin a tapa Zebadiah ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hla ngana-a a ngana pa pen Izhar-te Shamhuth ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hla guhna-a a guhna pa pen Teko-te Ikkesh’ tapa Ira ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hla sagina-a a sagina pa pen Ephraim-te sung panin Pelon-te Helez ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hla gietna-a a gietna pa pen Zerah-te sung panin Hushah-te Sibbecai ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hla kuona- a a kuona pa pen Benjamin-te sung panin Anathoth-te Abiezer ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hla sawmna-a a sawmna pa pen Zerah-te sung panin Netophah-te Maharai ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hla sawm le khatna-a a sawm le khatna pa pen Ephraim-te sung panin Pirathon-te Benaiah ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hla sawm le nina-a sawm le nina pa pen Othniel-te sung panin Natophah-te Heldai ahi hi; ama’ khen sungah mi tul sawmni le tulli a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel minamte tungah Reuben-te adingin Zichri’ tapa Eliezer pen uhpi pa ahi hi; Simeon-te adingin Maacah’ tapa Shephatiah ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi adingin Kemuel’ tapa Hashabiah ahi hi; Aaron adingin Zadok ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah adingin David’ sanggamte sung panin Elihu ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zebulun adingin Obadiah’ tapa Ishmaiah ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraim-te adingin Azariah’ tapa Hoshea ahi hi; Manasseh minam alangte adingin Pedaiah’ tapa Joel ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gilead gam sunga Manasseh minam alangte adingin Zechariah’ tapa Iddo ahi hi; Benjamin adingin Abner’ tapa Jaasiel ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan adingin Jehoram’ tapa Azarel ahi hi; tam teng pen Israel minam makaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in vana aasi za-a a tam dingin Israel a khapsa ahi ziehin David in kum sawmni le a neisie mite sim lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Joab in amate a phaza sim ding kipan a, hizongle ama man sieng zo lo hi; hizongle tam thu ziehin Israel tungah lungthahna tung a, Kumpi David’ khang tangthu sungah tua a kisim mite a phaza kikhum lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Adiel’ tapa Azmaveth in kumpipa’ vanmanpha koina-ah vai a hawm hi. Gam sung, khuopite, khuoneute, le tausangte sunga vanmanpha koinate tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Uzziah’ tapa Jonathan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lo nasem, lohlote tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Chelub’ tapa Ezri ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengga lote-a vaihawm ding pa pen Ramah-te Shimei ahi hi. Lengga lo pana a pieng lenggazu koinate tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Shiphmoth-te Zabdi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Shephelah gam sunga a om olive le theitheh kungte tunga vaihawm ding pa khu Gederah-te Baal-hanan ahi hi. Sathau koinate tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Joash ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sharon gam sunga a gamta ganhonte tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Adlai’ tapa Shaphat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kalaohte tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Ishmael-te Obil ahi hi. Laa a nute tunga vaihawm ding pa pen Meronoth-te Jehdeiah ahi hi. Tuuhonte tunga vaihawm ding pen Hagri-te Jaziz ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam teng zosie Kumpipa David’ neisa kemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David’ pano Jonathan pen thu theitel mi le laithei mi ahi ziehin thu kuppipa ahi hi; Hachmoni’ tapa Jehiel in kumpipa’ tapate a cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahithophel pen kumpipa’ thu kuppipa ahi a, Archi-te Hushai pen kumpipa’ zawlpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahithophel’ nua ciengin Benaiah’ tapa Jehoiada le Abiathar in ama laih a, Joab pen kumpipa’ galkapmangpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in Israel uliente, minam uliente, kumpipa’ na a sem a khen khena uliente, a tul uh galkap uliente, a za uh galkap uliente, neisa zosie le kumpipa’ ganhonte le a tapate a kemte, kumpi inn sung uliente, mi thahat galhangte, le galhang zosie tawh Jerusalem ah a unpi-un a kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin a keng tawh Kumpi David dingto a, “Ka sanggamte le ka mite aw, ka thu gen za un. Keima in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong ading le i Pasien’ keng ngah nading tawlngahna biehinn khat lam dingin ka gel zo ta hi; tua biehinn adingin ka kigingkhol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle Pasien in keima kungah, ‘Nang galhang khat na hi a, sisan luongsah zo na hi ziehin keima’ min dingin biehinn na lam sih ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel Topa Pasien in ka pu innkuonte zosie sung panin Israel tungah kumpi a sem zing dingin keima ei teel hi; bangzieh ahei cile ama in makai dingin Judah teel a, Judah innkuon sung panin ka pa’ innkuon, ka pa’ tapate sung panin Israel zosie tunga kumpi sem dingin keima ei lungkimpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in tapa tampi ei pie ahi ziehin keima’ tapate zosie sung panin Israel tung, Topa’ kumpi topha tunga a to dingin ama in ka tapa Solomon a teel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, ‘Ka biehinn le ka inntuolte a lam ding pa khu nangma’ tapa Solomon ahi hi. Azieh pen keima in ka tapa dingin ama ka teel zo a, keima ama’ pa ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in ka thupiehnate le ka biehna ngaina kipte tuni-a ma bangin zui dinga a ngaisut peisuoh nah leh keima in a kumpi gam ka kipsah den ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in tami gam hoi tangin na nua vua na tate uh tungah gamh-in na nuasie tawntung thei nadingun Topa mai-a kikhopna ahi Israel zosie’ muna le i Pasien’ zahna-ah na Topa Pasien thupiehna zosie zui-in sui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nang, ka tapa Solomon aw, na pa’ Pasien thei inlen, lungsim khat le lawpna lungtang tawh ama’ na sem in; azieh pen Topa in lungsim zosie sui a, gelna le ngaisutna zosie thei hi. Nang in ama na sui leh ama in nang ang mu ding a, ama na elngat leh ama in zong a tawntungin nang ang nuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Munsiengtho adingin biehinn khat a lam dingin Topa in nang ang teel zo ziehin tu-in kingaisun in; thahat inlen sem in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a tapa Solomon kungah biehinn talaap, a innte, a vanmanpha koinate, a khan tungnungte, a khan sungtate, le hepina topha dinga a innkhan gelna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale Topa’ biehinn tuolte adinga a lungsim sunga a ngaisut zosie, a kimvela innkhan zosie, Pasien’ biehinn sung vanmanpha koinate, le a ki-ap letsongte adingin vanmanpha koina’ innlimte pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />siempute, Levi a kisekhente le Topa’ biehinn sunga nasepna zosie ading; Topa’ biehinn sunga nasepna ding vanzah zosie ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na sepna khat sima zah ding kham tawh kibawl vanzah zosie a gihna, nasepna sima zah ding ngun tawh kibawl vanzahte a gihna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kham meivah khuom le a meivahte a gihna, meivah khuom khat ciet a gihna le a meivahte gihna, ngun meivah khuom ding le nasepna-ah a poimaw dung zui-a zah dingin meivah teng gihna zong a unin tesa-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ompina Anlum adingin sabuoi kham a gihna ciet, ngun sabuoite ading ngun a gihna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />le tawkeukate, kuongte, le haite adingin kham citah a gihna; kham haipite le a gihna ciet, ngun haipite le a gihna ciet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a kisiengsah kham tawh a kibawl gimnamtui halna maitam ding le a gihna za ding gelna; a hlate uh zahin Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a khu cherub-te’ khamleeng ding a gelna zong a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa’ lamlahna tawh a kigiel nasepna gelna tamteng zosie ama in a unin keima ei theiciensah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in a tapa Solomon kungah, “Hattah le hangsan tahin om inlen sem in. Zau sinlen lungkie sin; azieh pen Topa Pasien, keima’ Pasien in nangma ang ompi hi. Topa’ biehinn nasepna zosie a kizaw sieng masangsie ama in nangma ang tamasah sih ding a, zong ang nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn nasep zosie a sem dingin siempute le Levi mi kisekhente om a, nasepna khat popo-ah siemna a nei a kipumpieh zosie in a nasepna vannuoi vuah nangma tawh ang om ding uhi. Uliente le mi zosie zong nang’ thupiehna bangbangin a gamta ding uhi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi David in a kikhawm mipite kungah, “Pasien in ama beh a teelsa ka tapa Solomon lah khangno lai-in bangma a thei nai sih a, nasep ding lah a lien mama hi; azieh pen biehinn lah mihing ading hi loin Topa ading ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien’ biehinn dingin keima in ka hi thei za cieng, phu dingin onyx suong, suongpa, suong pawl, suong kang, le suong manpha nam zosie, le suongzol tampite banah kham zahna dingah kham, ngun zahna dingah ngun, le sumngo zahna dingah sumngo, sia zahna dingah sia, sing zahna dingah sing ka khol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tham loin a siengtho biehinn adingin ka pieh teng zosie banah keima’ gou ahi ngun le kham zong om a, ka Pasien’ biehinn adingin ka kipumpieh ziehin keima in ka Pasien’ biehinn-a ka piehte:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biehinn kawm zut nadingin Ophir gam kham talent tulthum, le a kisiengsahsa ngun talent tul sagi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />le mi khutsiemte in a bawl ding nasepna zosie adingin kham zahna dingah kham, ngun zahna dingah ngun ahi hi. Tuni-in Topa kungah no le no kisiensuo-in kiphal taha a kipumpieh koi teng a om vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin pupa innkuon lutangte in amau’ nopthu-in piehkhietna a bawl vua, minam makaite, a tul le a za a uhte, le kumpipa’ nasepna a uh uliente in zong a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien’ biehinn nasepna dingin kham talent tulnga le kham darics tul sawm, ngun talent tul sawm, sumngo talent tul sawm le tul giet, le sia talent tul zakhat a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suong manpha a nei poma in zong Topa’ biehinn sunga van manpha kikoina munah Gershon-te Jehiel’ kep dingin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin tam mite in phalna tawh a pieh ziehun mite kipah mama hi. Bangzieh ahei cile lung khat suongin Topa kungah suohta tahin a pie uhi; Kumpi David zong nahpi tahin a lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a kikhawm mipi zosie’ opna-ah Topa phat hi; David in, “ Topa , ka pu ka pa uh Israel Pasien aw, nang in kum tawnin thupha nga ta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, lietna, vanglietna, minthanna, guolzawna, le thupina nangma-a’ ahi hi. Azieh pen vantung le leitunga om zosie nangma-a’ ahi hi; Topa aw, kumpi gam nangma-a’ ahi a, tuate zosie tungah nangma a lutangin ang kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma kung panin haunate le pahtawinate ang pei a, nangma in na zosie na uh hi. Nangma’ khut sungah vanglietna le hatna a om hi; tuale nangma’ khut sungah mi zosie lietsah nading le thakhausah nading a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote’ Pasien aw, tu-in nangma kungah kipah thu kang tut vua, a minthang nangma’ min ka phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ahi vangin tam bang nop thu-a biehna ka bawl thei nadingun kei koi ka hi a, ka mite koi ka hi uh ahei? Azieh pen na zosie nangma kung pana ang pei ahi a, nangma kungah nangma-a’ ma kang pieh uh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen ka pu ka pate zosie uh ma bangin nangma mai-ah kote khuolmi le pemta ka hi lel uhi; leitungah ka hunte uh nihlim bang ahi a, lamet ding a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa kohaw’ Pasien aw, na min siengtho adingin biehinn khat lam nadinga ka kholsa uh tami sil tampi zosie a unpi-in nangma khut sung pana ang pei ahi a, a unpi-in nangma-a’ ma ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, lungtang na sui a, thutangah na lungkim lam ka thei hi; ka lungsim dihna tawh tam sil zosie kang pie zo hi. Tu-in keima in nangma tungah suohta tah le kipahtaha ang pie, tam sunga om na mite ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate uh Abraham, Isaac, le Israel Pasien, Topa aw, na mite’ lungsim sungah tua bang ngimnate le ngaisutnate omsah zing inlen, nangma lamah amau’ lungsim kai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in na thupiehnate, na thu khensatte, le na thukhamte zosie zui-in tuate zosie a sem a, keima in ama ka piehsa biehinn a lam thei nadingin ka tapa Solomon tungah lawpna lungsim guon in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a kikhawm mipi zosie kungah, “ Topa na Pasien uh thupha pie un,” a ci hi. A kikhawm mipi zosie in a pu a pate uh’ Pasien Topa thupha pie-in a lukun vua, Topa le kumpipa mai-ah a khupbawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zing ni ciengin amate in Topa tungah biehpiehnate a pie vua, Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin bawngtang tulkhat, tuutang tulkhat, le tuuno tulkhat, dawnthei a biehna utawh, le Israel mi zosie adingin biehpiehna tampi a pie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuale Topa mai-ah tua ni-in kipahna lienpi tawh an ne tui dawnin a om uhi. Amate in David’ tapa Solomon a niveina kumpi-in a bawl uhi; amate in Topa mai-ah ulien dingin ama sathau nu-in siempu dingin Zadok sathau a nu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in a pa David’ kumpi za luo-in Topa’ kumpi topha tungah a to hi. Ama a dau pei a, Israel mi zosie in a thu a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Makai zosie le mihat galhangte, le Kumpi David’ tapa zosie in zong Kumpi Solomon’ thu a mang dingin a kiciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mi zosie muna-ah Topa in nahpi tahin Solomon domsang a, Israel sungah ama masangin kumpi khat popo tungah a kipie ngai nai lo kumpi thupina ama tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Jessi’ tapa David in Israel zosie tungah a uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama Israel tunga a maan hun pen kum sawmli sung ahi hi; tuale ama Hebron ah kum sagi sung, Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum le thum sung a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama vuoi-in a ni a hun cingin hauna le minthanna tawh a si hi; tuale a tapa Solomon in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu-in Kumpi David’ nasep teng a bul panin a tawp tanin thumu pa Samuel Khang Sutna sung, kamsang Nathan’ Khang Sutna sung, le thumu pa Gad’ Khang Sutna sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ama uhna le a thahatna zosie le ama tung, Israel tung, le leitung kumpi gam zosie tunga a tung thute ciemtenate tawh kigiel ton hi.
  </para>
</usx>
